1242
01:07:00,500 --> 01:07:04,125
<i>Without friendship, where is peace?</i>

1243
01:07:04,416 --> 01:07:07,750
<i>What moonlight can life offer?</i>

1244
01:07:08,291 --> 01:07:11,875
<i>Hand in hand, we drift like fireflies</i>

1245
01:07:12,250 --> 01:07:15,416
<i>My heart is veiled in the morning mist</i>

1246
01:07:16,250 --> 01:07:19,666
<i>Where the heart dwells,
Time stands still</i>

1247
01:07:19,833 --> 01:07:23,708
<i>Time flutters by on delicate wings</i>

1248
01:07:23,916 --> 01:07:28,125
<i>Some journeys turn beautiful
When hearts unite…</i>

1249
01:07:43,750 --> 01:07:48,458
Lara Dominic,
do you take Sachin as your husband?

1250
01:07:49,000 --> 01:07:50,750
- Hey, say no.
- Lado, no!

1251
01:07:50,958 --> 01:07:52,541
- Say no!
- He brought a Father!

1252
01:07:52,666 --> 01:07:53,583
- Yes, Father!
- No…

1253
01:07:54,750 --> 01:07:56,250
- Sachin, do you take Lara--
- Yes, Father!

1254
01:07:56,875 --> 01:07:58,291
- Can I kiss the bride?
- Wait, wait, wait!

1255
01:08:00,125 --> 01:08:01,082
Looking for this?

1256
01:08:01,083 --> 01:08:03,125
<i>Where friendship thrives, sorrow fades
The heart carries no weight</i>

1257
01:08:03,375 --> 01:08:07,208
