<i>With memories lingering,
I stood in a different hue</i>

1262
01:08:38,791 --> 01:08:40,166
I request Doctor Noran

1263
01:08:40,291 --> 01:08:43,500
to distribute the convocation certificates
to the Department of Gynecologists.

1264
01:08:43,791 --> 01:08:45,125
Dr. Lara Dominic.

1265
01:08:47,208 --> 01:08:49,082
- Brother, you look happy!
- Congrats, Sachin, bro.

1266
01:08:49,083 --> 01:08:50,041
Dr. Priyanka.

1267
01:08:58,666 --> 01:09:00,500
- Wow! Wow! Wow!
- I am a doctor now.

1268
01:09:00,625 --> 01:09:02,165
From now on,
you'll handle the pregnancies.

1269
01:09:02,166 --> 01:09:03,374
And I'll handle the infants.

1270
01:09:03,375 --> 01:09:04,540
Bro, what do you mean?

1271
01:09:04,541 --> 01:09:06,499
She's a Gynecologist,
and I'm a Pediatrician.

1272
01:09:06,500 --> 01:09:07,832
- Oh, right!
- Ah, I get it.

1273
01:09:07,833 --> 01:09:09,583
So, this was your plan all along.

1274
01:09:09,833 --> 01:09:10,832
Well planned.

1275
01:09:10,833 --> 01:09:12,375
- Not bad!
- Dr. Amudha.

1276
01:09:12,958 --> 01:09:13,875
Hey!

1277
01:09:21,291 --> 01:09:24,708
How long will you keep romancing
through just your eyes?

1278
01:09:25,416 --> 01:09:27,208
Open your mouth
and profess your love for her.

1279
01:09:27,375 --> 01:09:28,375
I will!

1280
01:09:29,375 --> 01:09:30,375
When are you going to tell her?

1281
01:09:31,000 --> 01:09:32,708
She's more scared than you.

1282
01:09:33,166 --> 01:09:34,875
You must initiate.

1283
01:09:35,416 --> 01:09:37,250
I, too, wish to propose to her.

1284
01:09:38,208 --> 01:09:39,750
I will propose when the time is right.

1285
01:09:40,791 --> 01:09:42,625
This is your last chance.

1286
01:09:43,041 --> 01:09:44,416
She is going back to her hometown.

1287
01:09:44,833 --> 01:09:46,333
For God's sake, propose to her now.

1288
01:09:47,208 --> 01:09:48,833
If you miss now, she won't return.

1289
01:09:52,416 --> 01:09:54,250
I will propose to her
before she leaves town.

1290
01:09:54,458 --> 01:09:55,375
Enough?

1291
01:09:56,750 --> 01:09:58,332
He will never say it. I'll tell her.

1292
01:09:58,333 --> 01:09:59,500
- Hey!
- Stop being stupid.

1293
01:10:00,333 --> 01:10:01,458
I'm not the old Idhaya anymore.

1294
01:10:01,583 --> 01:10:03,041
Wait and watch,
this time I'll tell her.

1295
01:10:04,916 --> 01:10:05,875
All the best!

1296
01:10:09,291 --> 01:10:11,041
- What time is your train?
- At night, 8 pm.

1297
01:10:12,375 --> 01:10:13,958
So, Uncle, what's next?

1298
01:10:14,083 --> 01:10:16,125
It's her life.
She must make the decision.

1299
01:10:16,458 --> 01:10:17,790
What are you thinking about?

1300
01:10:17,791 --> 01:10:20,666
Didn't you say you're moving
to the UK and settling down there?

1301
01:10:21,041 --> 01:10:24,041
No, Prabhu,
I'm thinking of settling down in India.

1302
01:10:24,458 --> 01:10:26,165
I can't miss being in Chennai.

1303
01:10:26,166 --> 01:10:28,874
Moreover,
I can't leave Dad alone and go far…

1304
01:10:28,875 --> 01:10:30,540
So, is it marriage next?

1305
01:10:30,541 --> 01:10:31,999
She has to take a call about it.

1306
01:10:32,000 --> 01:10:35,541
Dear, do you like any doctor on campus?
Let's get you married to him.

1307
01:10:35,708 --> 01:10:39,416
No, I may marry anyone except a doctor.

1308
01:10:39,625 --> 01:10:41,833
Okay, right!

1309
01:10:44,541 --> 01:10:46,540
You marry as per your choice.

1310
01:10:46,541 --> 01:10:49,125
My only wish is for him
to look after you well.

1311
01:10:49,458 --> 01:10:51,666
- Yes, yes.
- Sir, as per your expectations,

1312
01:10:51,958 --> 01:10:53,999
to find a groom
who'd take good care of your daughter,

1313
01:10:54,000 --> 01:10:55,582
we at Wedding Art wish you the best.

1314
01:10:55,583 --> 01:10:57,457
<i>This is Wedding Art…</i>

1315
01:10:57,458 --> 01:10:59,333
- You guys keep talking. I'll bring my bag.
- Okay, Dad.

1316
01:10:59,916 --> 01:11:01,208
- Why, guys?
- Just for fun!

1317
01:11:01,500 --> 01:11:02,708
Hey, go and speak to him.

1318
01:11:03,000 --> 01:11:04,874
Try impressing your future father-in-law.

1319
01:11:04,875 --> 01:11:05,958
- Go, dude.
- Oh, really?

1320
01:11:14,791 --> 01:11:15,791
What are you looking at, sir?

1321
01:11:16,750 --> 01:11:21,500
It'll be beautiful
if you all stay together like this.

1322
01:11:24,833 --> 01:11:27,291
Ten years down the line,
we'd be the same.

1323
01:11:28,291 --> 01:11:30,750
If it happens, it'll be wonderful.
But it's not practical.

1324
01:11:31,666 --> 01:11:33,083
In the future, everything will change.

1325
01:11:33,500 --> 01:11:35,875
Each of you will pursue
different paths in life.

1326
01:11:36,208 --> 01:11:38,833
This auditorium will be filled
with a new set of friends.

1327
01:11:40,083 --> 01:11:41,000
We…

1328
01:11:44,041 --> 01:11:48,375
Why do I get the feeling that you've
kept something locked up in your heart?

1329
01:11:51,291 --> 01:11:56,125
Son, the moments
that slip away in life never return.

1330
01:11:57,500 --> 01:12:03,875
If we stay true to ourselves right now,
we won't regret it later.

1331
01:12:04,500 --> 01:12:07,208
So, whether it's happiness or sadness…

1332
01:12:07,916 --> 01:12:09,416
Speak your heart.

1333
01:12:10,125 --> 01:12:11,416
Don't keep postponing it.

1334
01:12:22,666 --> 01:12:24,833
I thought there was a party,
but I don't see anyone around.

1335
01:12:24,958 --> 01:12:26,083
Let's begin the party!

1336
01:12:26,875 --> 01:12:28,541
- It's not like that.
- Then how?

1337
01:12:28,833 --> 01:12:30,791
- Let's go.
- What happened?

1338
01:12:30,916 --> 01:12:32,458
Fine, I'll help Uncle.

1339
01:12:32,583 --> 01:12:33,500
Okay.

1340
01:12:33,916 --> 01:12:35,957
Bro! Why is Lado pissed at you?

1341
01:12:35,958 --> 01:12:37,874
We've been fighting.
She blocked me everywhere.

1342
01:12:37,875 --> 01:12:39,290
Forget about her.
Where's our guy?

1343
01:12:39,291 --> 01:12:41,707
- He's writing.
- What is he writing?

1344
01:12:41,708 --> 01:12:44,124
- He's writing a song.
- Song? He never mentioned it.

1345
01:12:44,125 --> 01:12:45,999
Yes, bro!
He's going to propose through a song.

1346
01:12:46,000 --> 01:12:47,040
Proposal song, you say?

1347
01:12:47,041 --> 01:12:48,458
- Oh, damn!
- Wait, I'll be back.

1348
01:12:49,666 --> 01:12:51,166
Hey, won't you even say sorry?

1349
01:12:51,750 --> 01:12:53,874
- Only I have to initiate it.
- What's your problem?

1350
01:12:53,875 --> 01:12:54,957
This is my problem.

1351
01:12:54,958 --> 01:12:57,082
When I'm with you,
have you ever put in any effort?

1352
01:12:57,083 --> 01:13:00,500
Look at him. For his love,
he's throwing a farewell party for us.

1353
01:13:00,625 --> 01:13:03,041
Have you ever
put in any effort like this?

1354
01:13:03,208 --> 01:13:04,875
You mean to say
I never did anything for you?

1355
01:13:05,125 --> 01:13:06,582
Didn't put in any effort?

1356
01:13:06,583 --> 01:13:08,790
Look at this silly girl.
Tell her about that matter.

1357
01:13:08,791 --> 01:13:09,708
What matter?

1358
01:13:10,500 --> 01:13:12,541
Hey, tell her about the song.

1359
01:13:12,958 --> 01:13:16,125
Hey, Lado,
bro has written a song for you.

1360
01:13:16,458 --> 01:13:17,499
- Oh, oh!
- Yes, baby.

1361
01:13:17,500 --> 01:13:20,000
He's going to sing a song
without stopping for a breath, for you.

1362
01:13:20,208 --> 01:13:22,416
- Dude, why would you?
- Is it true?

1363
01:13:22,916 --> 01:13:25,500
- Yes, wait and see.
- What are you going to sing?

1364
01:13:45,541 --> 01:13:48,666
<i>O beautiful parrot-like one
My beautiful little one</i>

1365
01:13:48,791 --> 01:13:52,375
<i>My treasured jewel,
Nesting in my tiny heart</i>

1366
01:13:52,875 --> 01:13:56,000
<i>O sculpted beauty…
My sculpted beauty</i>

1367
01:13:56,125 --> 01:13:59,416
<i>I want to be known in town
As your lover</i>

1368
01:13:59,583 --> 01:14:02,875
<i>I wish to be beside you
When the wedding bells ring</i>

1369
01:14:03,125 --> 01:14:06,458
<i>I long to see you
Blush beside me on that day</i>

1370
01:14:06,708 --> 01:14:10,416
<i>I want you etched
Beside my heart like a tattoo</i>

1371
01:14:10,541 --> 01:14:14,166
<i>I want to recite a poem</i>

1372
01:14:14,541 --> 01:14:16,250
<i>Hey, stunning beauty
O ravishing beauty</i>

1373
01:14:17,708 --> 01:14:19,791
<i>Hey, stunning beauty
O ravishing beauty</i>

1374
01:14:21,291 --> 01:14:24,791
<i>My stunning beauty,
The moment your eyes open</i>

1375
01:14:24,958 --> 01:14:28,583
<i>A single glance,
And you swept into my heart</i>

1376
01:14:28,875 --> 01:14:32,041
<i>Like a feast prepared
By a charming beauty</i>

1377
01:14:32,250 --> 01:14:35,708
<i>This lovely maiden
Is a spark of sheer bliss</i>

1378
01:14:36,250 --> 01:14:39,375
<i>Do you hesitate to confess your love,
Or are you simply spellbound?</i>

1379
01:14:39,791 --> 01:14:43,333
<i>Can a girl be just as smitten
As a boy?</i>

1380
01:14:43,541 --> 01:14:46,958
<i>Do thoughts of you melt my heart,
Or is it your closeness within?</i>

1381
01:14:47,125 --> 01:14:50,500
<i>If it's life's gift,
What more is there to say?</i>

1382
01:14:50,666 --> 01:14:53,916
<i>Come set my heart alight
Bring the match and strike it</i>

1383
01:14:54,041 --> 01:14:55,582
<i>Come and hold me close</i>

1384
01:14:55,583 --> 01:14:57,541
<i>With your father's blessing,
I'll make you mine</i>

1385
01:14:57,708 --> 01:14:59,249
<i>Come by my side</i>

1386
01:14:59,250 --> 01:15:01,291
<i>Let me proudly show you to my friends</i>

1387
01:15:01,416 --> 01:15:04,958
<i>Come, accept my love
Let me make you part of my family</i>

1388
01:15:39,750 --> 01:15:42,000
Hey, weren't you supposed
to sing without taking a breath?

1389
01:15:42,791 --> 01:15:43,708
Come on, sing.

1390
01:15:44,000 --> 01:15:45,791
Oh, yeah, I forgot about it.

1391
01:15:46,708 --> 01:15:47,750
I will do it for the next verse.

1392
01:15:48,208 --> 01:15:49,957
<i>A bouquet woven
From clustered blooms</i>

1393
01:15:49,958 --> 01:15:51,582
<i>A precious gem adorned with pearls</i>

1394
01:15:51,583 --> 01:15:53,415
<i>Beholding beauty
That enchants all around</i>

1395
01:15:53,416 --> 01:15:55,249
<i>A masterpiece
Adorned with delicate strokes</i>

1396
01:15:55,250 --> 01:15:57,040
<i>Graced by the moon's glow
And a river of gold</i>

1397
01:15:57,041 --> 01:15:58,750
<i>Beneath the moonlight,
Only truth remains</i>

1398
01:15:59,000 --> 01:16:00,915
<i>The joy here is beyond words</i>

1399
01:16:00,916 --> 01:16:02,249
<i>Where is your part in this joy,
My dear?</i>

1400
01:16:02,250 --> 01:16:03,874
<i>Do we embrace it,
Or set it free?</i>

1401
01:16:03,875 --> 01:16:05,624
<i>Will you scorn me,
Or embrace me?</i>

1402
01:16:05,625 --> 01:16:07,333
<i>Shall we learn to live in harmony?</i>

1403
01:16:07,458 --> 01:16:09,000
<i>Shall we fill our home with children?</i>

1404
01:16:09,166 --> 01:16:10,708
<i>Come along, my darling wife</i>

1405
01:16:10,916 --> 01:16:12,541
<i>I'll be waiting, eager as ever</i>

1406
01:16:12,750 --> 01:16:14,583
<i>A charm too precious to let go</i>

1407
01:16:14,791 --> 01:16:17,416
<i>I'll cherish and protect you forever</i>

1408
01:16:20,625 --> 01:16:24,083
<i>My stunning beauty,
The moment your eyes open</i>

1409
01:16:24,250 --> 01:16:27,916
<i>A single glance,
And you swept into my heart</i>

1410
01:16:28,083 --> 01:16:31,125
<i>Like a feast prepared
By a charming beauty</i>

1411
01:16:31,291 --> 01:16:34,958
<i>This lovely maiden
Is a spark of sheer bliss</i>

1412
01:16:35,458 --> 01:16:38,875
<i>Do you hesitate to confess your love,
Or are you simply spellbound?</i>

1413
01:16:39,083 --> 01:16:42,208
<i>Can a girl be just as smitten
As a boy?</i>

1414
01:16:42,666 --> 01:16:46,166
<i>Do thoughts of you melt my heart,
Or is it your closeness within?</i>

1415
01:16:46,333 --> 01:16:49,833
<i>If it's life's gift,
What more is there to say?</i>

1416
01:16:49,958 --> 01:16:53,249
<i>Come set my heart alight
Bring the match and strike it</i>

1417
01:16:53,250 --> 01:16:54,750
<i>Come and hold me close</i>

1418
01:16:54,875 --> 01:16:56,625
<i>With your father's blessing,
I'll make you mine</i>

1419
01:16:56,750 --> 01:16:58,540
<i>Come by my side</i>

1420
01:16:58,541 --> 01:17:00,375
<i>Let me proudly show you to my friends</i>

1421
01:17:00,541 --> 01:17:04,125
<i>Come, accept my love
Let me make you part of my family...</i>

1422
01:17:15,666 --> 01:17:16,957
<i>On that day, we didn't realize</i>

1423
01:17:16,958 --> 01:17:19,583
<i>that would be the last day
we were together.</i>

1424
01:17:38,208 --> 01:17:40,333
Hereafter, I won't need this key.

1425
01:17:43,750 --> 01:17:44,833
I'll miss you, Lado.

1426
01:17:53,833 --> 01:17:55,000
- Bye.
- Bye.

1427
01:17:56,000 --> 01:17:56,958
Aren't you coming?

1428
01:17:58,291 --> 01:17:59,208
I'll cry.

1429
01:18:01,291 --> 01:18:02,208
Okay.

1430
01:18:07,125 --> 01:18:09,166
Dude, you only have 35 minutes.

1431
01:18:09,291 --> 01:18:11,374
Before the Alappuzha Express
steals her away,

1432
01:18:11,375 --> 01:18:13,000
you reserve your chance
and confirm your love.

1433
01:18:13,125 --> 01:18:14,333
Hey, shut up!

1434
01:18:14,791 --> 01:18:16,041
Look, hear me out.

1435
01:18:16,208 --> 01:18:18,833
A railway station is the apt place
to propose your love.

1436
01:18:18,958 --> 01:18:20,708
<i>Mouna Ragam</i>: Karthik and Revathi.

1437
01:18:20,916 --> 01:18:23,916
<i>Dilwale Dulhania Le Jaayenge</i>:
Shahrukh and Kajol.

1438
01:18:24,333 --> 01:18:27,083
Then, <i>Kadhal Kottai</i>:
Devayani and Ajith.

1439
01:18:27,208 --> 01:18:30,000
A railway station
is the perfect spot to confess your love.

1440
01:18:30,333 --> 01:18:33,083
But when I see the railway station,
I only remember <i>Moondram Pirai</i>.

1441
01:18:33,208 --> 01:18:36,291
Instead of speaking nonsense, please tell
her those three words without hesitation.

1442
01:18:36,416 --> 01:18:38,083
- Okay? Amudha!
- Hey!

1443
01:18:39,125 --> 01:18:40,416
He wants to talk to you.

1444
01:18:42,416 --> 01:18:43,416
Don't mess it up.

1445
01:18:46,041 --> 01:18:46,958
What is it?

1446
01:18:47,458 --> 01:18:49,750
You guys keep talking.
Meanwhile, I'll get the platform tickets.

1447
01:18:54,208 --> 01:18:55,125
Tell me, Idhaya.

1448
01:18:57,000 --> 01:18:57,916
Hand me the bag.

1449
01:18:58,458 --> 01:18:59,375
I'll carry it.

1450
01:20:51,166 --> 01:20:52,583
- I'm sorry, sir.
- Watch out.

1451
01:20:52,791 --> 01:20:53,708
Sorry!

1452
01:20:54,166 --> 01:20:55,083
You…

1453
01:20:56,125 --> 01:20:57,125
When I see you,

1454
01:20:57,500 --> 01:20:59,875
it reminds me
of my friend from college.

1455
01:21:00,333 --> 01:21:01,333
Oh, okay, sir.

1456
01:21:12,208 --> 01:21:13,291
Are you checking your weight?

1457
01:21:13,583 --> 01:21:15,708
No! I'm checking what's in store for me.

1458
01:21:20,541 --> 01:21:21,458
What's written on it?

1459
01:21:21,750 --> 01:21:22,708
I won't tell.

1460
01:21:23,416 --> 01:21:24,375
Show!

1461
01:21:25,166 --> 01:21:26,083
Why don't you try?

1462
01:21:26,666 --> 01:21:27,666
I don't believe in it.

1463
01:21:27,958 --> 01:21:29,000
Please check.

1464
01:21:34,333 --> 01:21:35,332
Show!

1465
01:21:35,333 --> 01:21:36,708
- Show me the card.
- You didn't show yours.

1466
01:21:37,666 --> 01:21:38,750
You did not.

1467
01:21:39,041 --> 01:21:41,375
Reverse on me, huh!
Let's go!

1468
01:22:38,708 --> 01:22:39,666
All okay?

1469
01:22:59,916 --> 01:23:01,416
I got scared
that the train had really started.

1470
01:23:06,208 --> 01:23:07,291
So, what's next for you?

1471
01:23:12,041 --> 01:23:14,500
Not sure.
I'll get home and figure it out.

1472
01:23:16,541 --> 01:23:18,583
I'm going to miss you all.

1473
01:23:19,125 --> 01:23:21,083
It felt as though
everything had just begun.

1474
01:23:21,791 --> 01:23:22,791
But so soon…

1475
01:23:24,791 --> 01:23:26,041
You're going away on the train.

1476
01:23:26,916 --> 01:23:30,291
But I don't know why I feel like
I'm going to miss the train.

1477
01:23:33,458 --> 01:23:35,083
Before we knew it,
time had flown by.

1478
01:23:40,125 --> 01:23:41,458
What are your plans after this?

1479
01:23:42,083 --> 01:23:43,333
I have a lot of plans in mind.

1480
01:23:44,125 --> 01:23:45,750
But before that…

1481
01:23:46,208 --> 01:23:48,750
I would like to tell you
something important…

1482
01:23:50,333 --> 01:23:51,291
Do you have water?

1483
01:23:52,458 --> 01:23:53,375
No.

1484
01:23:53,916 --> 01:23:55,583
Shall I get you some water?

1485
01:23:56,291 --> 01:23:57,208
Wait!

1486
01:24:01,458 --> 01:24:03,208
- Brother, one bottle.
- What else?

1487
01:24:03,875 --> 01:24:05,125
Also, a pack of biscuits.

1488
01:24:18,666 --> 01:24:19,583
Here you go.

1489
01:24:20,583 --> 01:24:21,500
Hold this.

1490
01:24:23,125 --> 01:24:24,041
You're getting a call.

1491
01:24:24,583 --> 01:24:27,791
- It's okay, it's Dad. I'll get it later.
- Okay.

1492
01:24:28,833 --> 01:24:29,750
I…

1493
01:24:36,541 --> 01:24:37,500
I think it's time.

1494
01:24:38,166 --> 01:24:39,583
The train is about to leave.

1495
01:24:40,333 --> 01:24:41,416
There are still five minutes.

1496
01:24:42,416 --> 01:24:43,583
You're very late!

1497
01:24:44,583 --> 01:24:45,875
And your watch is slow as well.

1498
01:24:53,375 --> 01:24:54,958
The train is about to leave.
Tell her quickly.

1499
01:24:59,500 --> 01:25:02,333
Bye, Idhaya.
May all your wishes come true.

1500
01:25:02,625 --> 01:25:04,208
I hope all your dreams come true.

1501
01:25:04,916 --> 01:25:05,916
All the best.

1502
01:25:07,333 --> 01:25:08,250
Take care, okay.

1503
01:25:09,250 --> 01:25:10,166
Bye, Idhaya!

1504
01:25:15,958 --> 01:25:16,875
Damn you!

1505
01:25:34,208 --> 01:25:36,208
Son, you could've told her.

1506
01:25:38,666 --> 01:25:40,166
I had a friend named Raja.

1507
01:25:40,875 --> 01:25:43,458
Just like you,
he was madly in love.

1508
01:25:44,083 --> 01:25:46,375
But he never proposed his love to her.

1509
01:25:48,083 --> 01:25:49,083
What happened to him?

1510
01:25:50,458 --> 01:25:51,666
It's a long story.

1511
01:25:52,041 --> 01:25:53,500
But in these 20 minutes,

1512
01:25:53,916 --> 01:25:55,958
you took me back 20 years.

1513
01:25:56,791 --> 01:25:57,708
Thanks!

1514
01:26:21,291 --> 01:26:23,458
<i>In life, everyone gets only one chance,</i>

1515
01:26:23,666 --> 01:26:26,458
<i>but my chance ended
at the railway station.</i>

1516
01:26:29,500 --> 01:26:30,666
What are you thinking about?

1517
01:26:31,333 --> 01:26:32,250
If I were you,

1518
01:26:33,333 --> 01:26:38,125
I'd wonder why I couldn't say
those three words.

1519
01:26:40,541 --> 01:26:42,250
You were so close to that girl.

1520
01:26:43,333 --> 01:26:44,375
You should've told her, man.

1521
01:26:46,458 --> 01:26:48,416
Expressing yourself is easy when
there are no emotional ties involved.

1522
01:26:49,541 --> 01:26:51,750
But it's difficult to speak your heart

1523
01:26:52,666 --> 01:26:53,583
to someone you love.

1524
01:26:54,375 --> 01:26:55,291
Right?

1525
01:27:00,916 --> 01:27:04,375
<i>Many people, like me, couldn't
bring themselves to confess their love.</i>

1526
01:27:04,708 --> 01:27:06,041
<i>We couldn't express our love.</i>

1527
01:27:06,250 --> 01:27:07,958
<i>Or give a reason, either.</i>

1528
01:27:08,208 --> 01:27:09,666
<i>Idhaya!</i>

1529
01:27:12,041 --> 01:27:13,875
<i>Some things remained only a dream, sir.</i>

1530
01:27:14,208 --> 01:27:15,875
<i>Had it become a reality,
it would've been wonderful.</i>

1531
01:27:16,000 --> 01:27:17,333
<i>But it never got fulfilled.</i>

1532
01:27:17,666 --> 01:27:21,416
<i>Similarly,
I never expressed my love for Amudha.</i>

1533
01:27:21,875 --> 01:27:24,958
<i>After that,
life took everyone on different paths.</i>

1534
01:27:25,750 --> 01:27:27,375
<i>A few bonds were made.</i>

1535
01:27:30,416 --> 01:27:31,958
<i>A few bonds were broken.</i>

1536
01:27:33,166 --> 01:27:35,041
<i>Life was running faster than ever.</i>

1537
01:27:35,541 --> 01:27:38,125
<i>When I looked back,
five years had gone by.</i>

1538
01:27:41,333 --> 01:27:44,666
{\an8}<i>I'm proud to say
that DTV is entering its fourth year.</i>

1539
01:27:44,791 --> 01:27:47,082
{\an8}<i>Many congratulations
and thank you to one and all.</i>

1540
01:27:47,083 --> 01:27:48,000
Guys!

1541
01:27:48,625 --> 01:27:50,208
It's time to celebrate!

1542
01:27:53,541 --> 01:27:56,749
On this joyous occasion,
I'd like to share a few thoughts.

1543
01:27:56,750 --> 01:28:00,458
The work you all have been
doing as a team, once I did it alone.

1544
01:28:00,625 --> 01:28:02,333
Installing cable TV in every house.

1545
01:28:02,500 --> 01:28:03,500
Collecting payments.

1546
01:28:03,625 --> 01:28:05,166
Hosting movie nights on a VCR.

1547
01:28:05,416 --> 01:28:07,958
Going from one roof top to another
to repair TV antennas.

1548
01:28:08,125 --> 01:28:09,208
In those days,

1549
01:28:09,416 --> 01:28:12,291
there was a person who helped me
monitor the clarity of the TV relay.

1550
01:28:12,583 --> 01:28:14,083
That's none other than my cute Idhaya.

1551
01:28:17,291 --> 01:28:20,041
On this joyous occasion,
I come bearing good news.

1552
01:28:20,333 --> 01:28:21,958
We were regional all these years.

1553
01:28:22,833 --> 01:28:24,999
Now we'll be participating
in the National Television race.

1554
01:28:25,000 --> 01:28:27,000
Now, let's give ourselves
a huge round of applause!

1555
01:28:30,000 --> 01:28:30,916
Thank you.

1556
01:28:31,833 --> 01:28:32,875
Congratulations, Boss!

1557
01:28:33,000 --> 01:28:33,916
Yes, my boy!

1558
01:28:35,375 --> 01:28:36,291
Let's celebrate.

1559
01:28:43,083 --> 01:28:44,416
Hi! How are you?

1560
01:28:44,541 --> 01:28:46,500
How come you're calling?
Do you still remember us?

1561
01:28:46,791 --> 01:28:48,957
Dude, this is too much!

1562
01:28:48,958 --> 01:28:50,833
Are you at a gym?

1563
01:28:51,000 --> 01:28:55,291
Yes! I nailed it
by losing 750 gms in three months.

1564
01:28:56,708 --> 01:28:58,374
It's been a long time
since I saw you smile.

1565
01:28:58,375 --> 01:29:00,040
Stay like this.
You should always be smiling.

1566
01:29:00,041 --> 01:29:01,415
- Wait, I'm adding others.
- Sure, add them.

1567
01:29:01,416 --> 01:29:02,708
- Hi!
- Hi!

1568
01:29:03,041 --> 01:29:04,625
- Hi, dude.
- Sachin bro!

1569
01:29:05,583 --> 01:29:07,749
- When is your wedding?
- Wedding, really?

1570
01:29:07,750 --> 01:29:09,249
How? How did you know?

1571
01:29:09,250 --> 01:29:10,583
Are you really getting married?

1572
01:29:10,750 --> 01:29:12,124
Hey, Dravid, how did you know?

1573
01:29:12,125 --> 01:29:14,291
Only two types of men go to the gym.

1574
01:29:14,458 --> 01:29:16,375
One who tries to fix himself
after a breakup.

1575
01:29:16,583 --> 01:29:17,790
Another who's getting married.

1576
01:29:17,791 --> 01:29:19,083
You belong to the second type.

1577
01:29:19,208 --> 01:29:21,083
Oh, please wait.
I'll connect Lado.

1578
01:29:21,375 --> 01:29:23,125
Hey! Don't do it!

1579
01:29:23,250 --> 01:29:24,583
Please take the phone away from her.

1580
01:29:24,708 --> 01:29:26,000
Guys, jokes apart.

1581
01:29:26,458 --> 01:29:28,333
Next month, on the 24th,
my wedding is in Madurai.

1582
01:29:28,583 --> 01:29:29,665
All of you are invited.

1583
01:29:29,666 --> 01:29:31,249
We're going to enjoy ourselves
and have fun!

1584
01:29:31,250 --> 01:29:32,666
- Fun it is.
- Oh, wait!

1585
01:29:32,916 --> 01:29:33,999
You never said who the girl is.

1586
01:29:34,000 --> 01:29:36,415
Shit! I forgot to mention.
Her name is Tulasi.

1587
01:29:36,416 --> 01:29:37,874
When you guys come down,
I'll introduce her.

1588
01:29:37,875 --> 01:29:38,958
- Sure!
- Tulasi?

1589
01:29:39,083 --> 01:29:40,708
- Okay, see you guys. Bye!
- Hey!

1590
01:29:40,833 --> 01:29:42,041
<i>Please wait!</i>

1591
01:29:42,333 --> 01:29:43,916
<i>Let's talk for a while.</i>

1592
01:29:44,166 --> 01:29:46,458
It's been a long time
since we laughed over a call.

1593
01:29:47,291 --> 01:29:48,208
You're right!

1594
01:29:49,083 --> 01:29:50,290
I, too, miss you guys a lot.

1595
01:29:50,291 --> 01:29:52,625
But aren't you guys staying
in the same building?

1596
01:29:52,750 --> 01:29:54,999
On different floors.
What are you both missing out on?

1597
01:29:55,000 --> 01:29:57,625
- You guys must be together all the time.
- Don't get me started.

1598
01:29:57,791 --> 01:30:01,040
Idhaya and I work in the same office. He's
on the 3rd floor, I'm on the 2nd floor.

1599
01:30:01,041 --> 01:30:03,625
- But it's been 3 weeks since I met him.
- Has it been 3 weeks?

1600
01:30:05,083 --> 01:30:07,416
What was the biggest issue
back then for us as students?

1601
01:30:07,833 --> 01:30:09,666
Lado and Sachin were on-and-off
in their relationship.

1602
01:30:10,125 --> 01:30:12,250
Idhaya had issues confessing his love.

1603
01:30:12,583 --> 01:30:14,875
And I had issues sneaking out to
meet him without my family knowing.

1604
01:30:15,083 --> 01:30:16,999
Okay! Don't get too emotional.

1605
01:30:17,000 --> 01:30:19,333
Come to Madurai,
we'll enjoy for four days.

1606
01:30:19,458 --> 01:30:20,791
We're going to enjoy!

1607
01:30:20,916 --> 01:30:22,833
<i>- Okay, guys, see you!
- Bye, Idhaya.</i>

1608
01:30:27,583 --> 01:30:32,250
<i>Butterflies… are fluttering</i>

1609
01:30:33,416 --> 01:30:37,833
<i>A game of hide-and-seek… is on</i>

1610
01:31:02,791 --> 01:31:08,582
<i>Don't keep those untold stories
Locked in your heart</i>

1611
01:31:08,583 --> 01:31:14,333
<i>Don't keep your passion trapped inside...</i>

1612
01:31:15,750 --> 01:31:18,540
Bro, if you don't wear the guard,
even God can't help you.

1613
01:31:18,541 --> 01:31:19,458
I ought to!

1614
01:31:20,125 --> 01:31:25,749
<i>Express the love in your eyes with words,
And it will blossom</i>

1615
01:31:25,750 --> 01:31:28,500
<i>Sorrows faded away</i>

1616
01:31:28,625 --> 01:31:31,250
<i>Even the colors celebrate us</i>

1617
01:31:31,416 --> 01:31:36,250
<i>My heart echoes your every word</i>

1618
01:31:37,083 --> 01:31:39,707
<i>Butterflies are fluttering</i>

1619
01:31:39,708 --> 01:31:42,375
<i>A game of hide-and-seek is on</i>

1620
01:31:42,500 --> 01:31:45,250
<i>Everything looks lush and green</i>

1621
01:31:45,541 --> 01:31:47,500
<i>Beautiful birds circle in our sight</i>

1622
01:31:50,708 --> 01:31:52,208
- Hello!
- Hello, son.

1623
01:31:52,541 --> 01:31:55,333
Hindu Religious and Charitable Endowments
Minister, Paranthaman speaking.

1624
01:31:55,458 --> 01:31:59,125
<i>There are a million ways
for a TV channel to trend in Tamil Nadu.</i>

1625
01:31:59,458 --> 01:32:01,165
Instead, you guys are always accusing me,

1626
01:32:01,166 --> 01:32:05,541
publishing bad news about me.
Which may infuriate my cadres.

1627
01:32:05,791 --> 01:32:07,833
Listen, I may be silent
and won't react to it.

1628
01:32:08,000 --> 01:32:09,541
But my cadres won't stay silent.

1629
01:32:09,708 --> 01:32:11,791
- So, I'm gently warning you.
- Thanks for your concern, sir.

1630
01:32:15,083 --> 01:32:16,000
{\an8}IDHAYA

1631
01:32:17,166 --> 01:32:19,083
{\an8}- Who are you waiting for?
- Arrow through the heart.

1632
01:32:19,541 --> 01:32:20,499
{\an8}That's me!

1633
01:32:20,500 --> 01:32:21,666
{\an8}- Nephew!
- Uncle!

1634
01:32:21,791 --> 01:32:22,790
Welcome!

1635
01:32:22,791 --> 01:32:24,749
Seeing the groom,
I thought his friends would be stout,

1636
01:32:24,750 --> 01:32:26,415
but you look fit, with a six-pack.

1637
01:32:26,416 --> 01:32:27,458
Oh, come on!

1638
01:32:28,458 --> 01:32:30,208
That's my niece in the back seat.

1639
01:32:30,333 --> 01:32:32,416
She wanted to get a SIM card,
so I brought her along.

1640
01:32:32,583 --> 01:32:34,250
Enough reactions.
Please get inside the car.

1641
01:32:40,000 --> 01:32:41,708
Take a look
at the Madurai Medical College.

1642
01:32:42,041 --> 01:32:42,958
Looks good.

1643
01:32:43,416 --> 01:32:44,875
They are very efficient.

1644
01:32:46,208 --> 01:32:47,916
You should not be on a diet
when you're in Madurai.

1645
01:32:48,083 --> 01:32:50,375
- You must eat your heart's content.
- I understand.

1646
01:32:51,416 --> 01:32:53,290
You've come to our
city for the first time.

1647
01:32:53,291 --> 01:32:54,916
Let's start by having <i>Jigarthanda</i>.

1648
01:32:55,125 --> 01:32:56,708
- Sure.
- Yes, you must have it.

1649
01:32:57,875 --> 01:32:59,207
It's harder to get off than getting in.

1650
01:32:59,208 --> 01:33:00,457
<i>We've arrived.
Where are you?</i>

1651
01:33:00,458 --> 01:33:02,249
First, hear me out.
Do you know who I just saw?

1652
01:33:02,250 --> 01:33:03,166
<i>Who?</i>

1653
01:33:30,041 --> 01:33:31,708
Hey, Idhaya?

1654
01:33:32,333 --> 01:33:33,833
- Yes!
- What are you doing over here?

1655
01:33:35,125 --> 01:33:37,041
- Samyuktha…
- Samantha.

1656
01:33:37,208 --> 01:33:39,541
Samantha, Hi. How are you?

1657
01:33:39,666 --> 01:33:40,666
I'm doing well.

1658
01:33:41,208 --> 01:33:42,833
It's been ages since I last saw you.

1659
01:33:43,125 --> 01:33:44,583
The last time was at the coaching class.

1660
01:33:44,750 --> 01:33:46,208
Now, we are settled in Chennai.

1661
01:33:46,375 --> 01:33:47,291
What brings you here?

1662
01:33:47,708 --> 01:33:49,124
What's with the formal addressing?

1663
01:33:49,125 --> 01:33:50,375
The bride is my cousin.

1664
01:33:50,750 --> 01:33:52,416
Wait! Where are your friends?

1665
01:33:52,541 --> 01:33:53,833
Everyone is on their way.

1666
01:33:54,291 --> 01:33:55,250
Nice, nice!

1667
01:33:56,125 --> 01:33:58,291
Sorry, I was on a work call.

1668
01:33:58,500 --> 01:33:59,666
That's why I didn't notice you.

1669
01:34:00,166 --> 01:34:02,041
That's okay.
In which IT company do you work?

1670
01:34:02,916 --> 01:34:04,000
IT company?

1671
01:34:05,666 --> 01:34:06,666
I work for NASA!

1672
01:34:07,125 --> 01:34:09,750
I work for NASA
in a space research program.

1673
01:34:10,125 --> 01:34:12,375
Oh, okay!
Space research, you say?

1674
01:34:13,416 --> 01:34:14,333
Yeah, in the space.

1675
01:34:15,291 --> 01:34:16,291
Like an astronaut?

1676
01:34:16,583 --> 01:34:17,916
Ah, yes.

1677
01:34:18,250 --> 01:34:21,291
Sometimes I work as a scientist
and sometimes as an engineer.

1678
01:34:21,625 --> 01:34:23,750
But right now we're starting
a new mission.

1679
01:34:24,541 --> 01:34:26,375
Wow! Nice!

1680
01:34:28,125 --> 01:34:30,708
- What about your twin sister?
- You mean, Samyuktha?

1681
01:34:30,958 --> 01:34:33,250
- Yeah, Samyuktha.
- She's married and settled in Australia.

1682
01:34:33,833 --> 01:34:36,125
Oh, you guys already know each other.

1683
01:34:36,458 --> 01:34:38,707
But I'm used to buying <i>Jigarthanda</i>,
whoever arrives in Madurai.

1684
01:34:38,708 --> 01:34:39,708
- Have it.
- Thanks.

1685
01:34:40,208 --> 01:34:41,915
- Thanks, Uncle.
- Always listening to music.

1686
01:34:41,916 --> 01:34:44,040
- Yes, tell me, bro!
<i>- Idhaya, did you land? Where are you?</i>

1687
01:34:44,041 --> 01:34:46,249
- Tell him we're at FAMOUS <i>Jigarthanda</i>.
- I'm here with your uncle.

1688
01:34:46,250 --> 01:34:47,708
<i>Step aside in private and talk.</i>

1689
01:34:48,416 --> 01:34:50,458
- Excuse me for a minute.
- Please go ahead.

1690
01:34:51,125 --> 01:34:52,041
What is it, bro?

1691
01:34:52,208 --> 01:34:54,124
<i>I invited Lado to the wedding by mistake.</i>

1692
01:34:54,125 --> 01:34:56,666
<i>She has come to create problems.
Now, I don't know what to do.</i>

1693
01:34:57,041 --> 01:34:58,874
- So what?
<i>- I can't send someone else to pick her.</i>

1694
01:34:58,875 --> 01:34:59,958
<i>Please go and pick her up.</i>

1695
01:35:00,083 --> 01:35:02,249
- Hey, don't drag me into this.
<i>- Dude, please help me.</i>

1696
01:35:02,250 --> 01:35:03,165
It won't work out.

1697
01:35:03,166 --> 01:35:05,916
<i>Please understand. It might
become a huge issue. If you bring her…</i>

1698
01:35:06,041 --> 01:35:08,540
<i>I'll manage by saying that
she came with you.</i>

1699
01:35:08,541 --> 01:35:09,999
<i>For God's sake, please bring her.</i>

1700
01:35:10,000 --> 01:35:11,415
- I can't, bro.
<i>- Please bring her. Bye!</i>

1701
01:35:11,416 --> 01:35:12,416
<i>- Bye-bye.</i>
- Hey!

1702
01:35:13,250 --> 01:35:14,499
Let's take them for lunch.

1703
01:35:14,500 --> 01:35:15,790
- Lunch, right?
- To the Pandian Hotel.

1704
01:35:15,791 --> 01:35:16,707
Let's make it a feast.

1705
01:35:16,708 --> 01:35:19,040
- Shall we make a move?
- No, I'm returning to the airport.

1706
01:35:19,041 --> 01:35:20,790
- Did you lose a bag?
- No, uncle.

1707
01:35:20,791 --> 01:35:21,999
An important friend is arriving.

1708
01:35:22,000 --> 01:35:23,333
- Friend?
- I must pick them up.

1709
01:35:23,666 --> 01:35:25,582
You guys go home. I'll take a cab.

1710
01:35:25,583 --> 01:35:27,957
Cab? Why trouble yourself
when we have a car?

1711
01:35:27,958 --> 01:35:29,290
Let's bring your friend along.

1712
01:35:29,291 --> 01:35:30,332
Let's go together.

1713
01:35:30,333 --> 01:35:31,999
It's okay, I can manage.

1714
01:35:32,000 --> 01:35:33,332
- Don't feel shy.
- Hey, come on.

1715
01:35:33,333 --> 01:35:35,166
We'll have the fish curry
on our way home.

1716
01:35:37,791 --> 01:35:39,958
- Shall I come along?
- No, I'll handle it.

1717
01:35:40,583 --> 01:35:42,166
Lado, what are you doing here?

1718
01:35:42,375 --> 01:35:44,250
Hey, Sachin is getting married.

1719
01:35:45,000 --> 01:35:47,208
Let me tell you something.
Sachin does not deserve you.

1720
01:35:47,458 --> 01:35:48,875
This is the truth. Understand?

1721
01:35:49,583 --> 01:35:52,166
I agree.
But Sachin is getting married.

1722
01:35:54,500 --> 01:35:55,458
- What happened?
- Lado.

1723
01:35:55,875 --> 01:35:58,166
Sachin's wife's relatives are in the car.

1724
01:35:58,500 --> 01:35:59,500
- Wife?
- Please be careful.

1725
01:35:59,875 --> 01:36:01,791
He's not yet married,
and you're already calling her his wife.

1726
01:36:01,916 --> 01:36:02,875
Then what should I call this?

1727
01:36:03,166 --> 01:36:05,832
Does it mean I'm his first wife?
Hello, we're not divorced yet.

1728
01:36:05,833 --> 01:36:07,582
- Excuse me, I have to say something.
- Please, Lado!

1729
01:36:07,583 --> 01:36:08,583
Sam, look over there.

1730
01:36:09,125 --> 01:36:10,915
Looks like they're head over heels
for each other.

1731
01:36:10,916 --> 01:36:13,124
The young couple wanted
to come in a cab for privacy.

1732
01:36:13,125 --> 01:36:14,583
But I spoiled it by barging in.

1733
01:36:14,708 --> 01:36:16,833
Please, please, please. Please, Lado.

1734
01:36:16,958 --> 01:36:18,458
Whatever it is, we'll discuss at home.

1735
01:36:18,833 --> 01:36:19,833
Okay, fine.

1736
01:36:20,500 --> 01:36:21,500
- Pick up my bag.
- Okay.

1737
01:36:22,500 --> 01:36:23,833
- Hold this as well.
- Hand it to me.

1738
01:36:24,000 --> 01:36:26,749
- Don't say anything, Lado.
- Okay, you shift to the front seat.

1739
01:36:26,750 --> 01:36:29,041
Let them take the back seat.
They might get offended.

1740
01:36:31,208 --> 01:36:33,208
How do you know the groom, Sachin?

1741
01:36:33,541 --> 01:36:34,832
He and I in college--

1742
01:36:34,833 --> 01:36:38,290
Uncle, we studied together in college.
That's how we became friends.

1743
01:36:38,291 --> 01:36:40,083
- Oh!
- Why aren't you letting me speak?

1744
01:36:40,250 --> 01:36:42,250
Listen, we'll go straight to the wedding,

1745
01:36:42,500 --> 01:36:44,332
then get back home and discuss further.

1746
01:36:44,333 --> 01:36:46,250
After that, we'll go back home.
Understand?

1747
01:36:46,833 --> 01:36:47,874
Did you notice, Sam?

1748
01:36:47,875 --> 01:36:51,290
I think they'll elope and get married
before Sachin gets married.

1749
01:36:51,291 --> 01:36:52,416
We must watch them carefully.

1750
01:37:02,416 --> 01:37:03,333
Wow!

1751
01:37:08,750 --> 01:37:10,165
Sam, why aren't you bringing the guests?

1752
01:37:10,166 --> 01:37:11,916
- You bring them, I have work.
- Fine, I'll do it.

1753
01:37:14,333 --> 01:37:15,916
- Hey, Idhaya!
- Hi, uncle.

1754
01:37:17,791 --> 01:37:19,708
- When did you arrive?
- I just arrived, Uncle.

1755
01:37:20,875 --> 01:37:21,875
Where's your son?

1756
01:37:24,958 --> 01:37:25,915
Okay.

1757
01:37:25,916 --> 01:37:28,499
- Why is she here?
- Not an issue. I'll handle her.

1758
01:37:28,500 --> 01:37:29,958
I'll handle her.
Don't worry about it.

1759
01:37:30,416 --> 01:37:31,374
Lado!

1760
01:37:31,375 --> 01:37:34,124
What do you mean? How could he
leave the lover who came to meet him?

1761
01:37:34,125 --> 01:37:36,291
Let's go inside. Always glaring at me.

1762
01:37:36,791 --> 01:37:38,124
Hey, Lado is coming.
How are we going to--

1763
01:37:38,125 --> 01:37:39,082
- Hi!
- Hi!

1764
01:37:39,083 --> 01:37:40,415
Hi, how are you people?

1765
01:37:40,416 --> 01:37:41,915
Where's Sachin? Is he inside?

1766
01:37:41,916 --> 01:37:43,665
- Hey, what's happening?
- Hey, not over there.

1767
01:37:43,666 --> 01:37:45,916
Wait, our room is over there.
Let's go and freshen up.

1768
01:37:46,750 --> 01:37:49,125
- Hey, Sachin's grandma.
- We'll meet her later.

1769
01:37:50,041 --> 01:37:53,000
- Where's the groom?
- He is in this room.

1770
01:37:54,750 --> 01:37:55,666
Dude!

1771
01:37:56,458 --> 01:37:57,375
How are you, bro?

1772
01:37:57,541 --> 01:37:59,041
- Excuse me!
- Carry on, son.

1773
01:38:00,791 --> 01:38:02,166
Why the hell did you invite Lado?

1774
01:38:02,333 --> 01:38:04,374
Dude, I called her when I was high.

1775
01:38:04,375 --> 01:38:06,999
I never expected her to show up
and cause problems.

1776
01:38:07,000 --> 01:38:09,291
Yeah, as if you're unaware of her traits.

1777
01:38:10,083 --> 01:38:11,791
People think she's my girlfriend.

1778
01:38:12,416 --> 01:38:15,208
Phew! So, I'm out of trouble then.

1779
01:38:15,375 --> 01:38:16,791
Why would it be an issue to you?

1780
01:38:18,250 --> 01:38:19,708
I don't exactly have an issue...

1781
01:38:31,708 --> 01:38:32,625
Dude!

1782
01:38:32,958 --> 01:38:35,000
Handle it for one day.
Tomorrow's my wedding.

1783
01:38:35,291 --> 01:38:37,208
Please manage Lado.

1784
01:38:38,625 --> 01:38:41,041
- I'll handle it, bro.
- Thank you, dude.

1785
01:38:44,375 --> 01:38:45,416
I'm so stressed!

1786
01:38:46,750 --> 01:38:48,708
I can't even get married in peace.

1787
01:38:48,916 --> 01:38:50,541
You should've thought about it
before you invited her.

1788
01:38:57,791 --> 01:38:59,083
Why the heck would they play this song?

1789
01:38:59,666 --> 01:39:01,083
Hey, it's our love anthem.

1790
01:39:01,208 --> 01:39:03,958
If she hears this…
She'll come down and torture me.

1791
01:39:04,916 --> 01:39:06,500
First, switch off this song.

1792
01:39:11,250 --> 01:39:14,874
Oh! So, everyone is happily gathered here.

1793
01:39:14,875 --> 01:39:16,791
But I've been crying like an idiot inside.

1794
01:39:17,333 --> 01:39:19,041
Wow!

1795
01:39:19,375 --> 01:39:20,916
The groom's charm is glowing on you.

1796
01:39:21,125 --> 01:39:23,708
New shirt, is it? Very nice!

1797
01:39:24,250 --> 01:39:25,166
Super!

1798
01:39:27,750 --> 01:39:30,125
Hi, Lado! How are you?

1799
01:39:31,208 --> 01:39:33,250
Look for yourself. Am I okay?

1800
01:39:34,375 --> 01:39:36,458
Look at my face.
Do I look okay?

1801
01:39:36,791 --> 01:39:37,708
You tell me.

1802
01:39:39,833 --> 01:39:42,208
What's your problem now?
What do you want?

1803
01:39:42,958 --> 01:39:45,541
Let's talk.
But first, call off the wedding.

1804
01:39:45,750 --> 01:39:48,000
Whatever it is, we'll sit down and talk.

1805
01:39:48,125 --> 01:39:49,915
- Okay. Please sit down.
- Are you kidding?

1806
01:39:49,916 --> 01:39:51,207
I'm not kidding. I'm serious.

1807
01:39:51,208 --> 01:39:52,207
- Let's talk.
- It's not a joke.

1808
01:39:52,208 --> 01:39:54,125
Please hear me out.
We'll sort this out.

1809
01:39:54,333 --> 01:39:55,374
Let's sit down and talk.

1810
01:39:55,375 --> 01:39:57,707
- Please call off the wedding.
- Lado, this is getting out of hand.

1811
01:39:57,708 --> 01:39:59,207
- Please wait, Idhaya.
- Let's go, Lado.

1812
01:39:59,208 --> 01:40:00,540
- Wait a minute.
- Please hear me out.

1813
01:40:00,541 --> 01:40:01,666
- Let me talk to him.
- No...

1814
01:40:01,833 --> 01:40:05,000
Idhaya, unlike you
I can't help but express my love.

1815
01:40:05,791 --> 01:40:06,916
I'll fight for my love!

1816
01:40:13,333 --> 01:40:14,250
Sit down.

1817
01:40:14,708 --> 01:40:17,041
Please sit down. Please!

1818
01:40:18,208 --> 01:40:20,250
Do you want me to marry you?

1819
01:40:21,500 --> 01:40:23,416
If I have to marry you…

1820
01:40:25,083 --> 01:40:26,083
Two families

1821
01:40:27,500 --> 01:40:29,875
are fast asleep with a wish that
the wedding is at the crack of dawn.

1822
01:40:31,208 --> 01:40:33,250
Do you want to ruin their wish
and get married?

1823
01:40:35,750 --> 01:40:36,625
Tell me, Lado.

1824
01:40:37,541 --> 01:40:39,875
I can understand.

1825
01:40:40,416 --> 01:40:42,250
I can understand
that you haven't moved on.

1826
01:40:42,666 --> 01:40:45,416
But Lado, please think about
the plight of the other girl.

1827
01:40:46,500 --> 01:40:48,583
If you still insist on us getting married…

1828
01:40:49,166 --> 01:40:50,083
I'm ready!

1829
01:40:50,250 --> 01:40:51,833
I'll do whatever you ask me to.

1830
01:40:53,166 --> 01:40:54,083
I will!

1831
01:40:55,333 --> 01:40:56,500
I respect you, Lado.

1832
01:40:57,791 --> 01:40:59,166
I really respect you.

1833
01:41:06,666 --> 01:41:07,625
Lado.

1834
01:41:09,666 --> 01:41:10,583
Lado!

1835
01:41:13,000 --> 01:41:15,583
In the future, I hope you won't
blackmail me with pictures.

1836
01:41:18,041 --> 01:41:19,415
Pig! What did you say?

1837
01:41:19,416 --> 01:41:20,791
What did you say?

1838
01:41:21,291 --> 01:41:22,500
You ditched me, dude.

1839
01:41:22,708 --> 01:41:24,915
I'm going to get married
to a better guy than you.

1840
01:41:24,916 --> 01:41:27,208
Someone like Mahesh Babu.
Look at yourself, though.

1841
01:41:33,083 --> 01:41:35,124
So, that means Lado
is not your girlfriend.

1842
01:41:35,125 --> 01:41:36,208
Nah, she's my friend.

1843
01:41:48,166 --> 01:41:50,291
<i>O dainty little parrot
Wrapped in a sari</i>

1844
01:41:50,541 --> 01:41:52,708
<i>O slender vine
Adorned with a garland</i>

1845
01:41:52,958 --> 01:41:54,916
<i>You're such a rare beauty
That any groom would be captivated</i>

1846
01:41:55,125 --> 01:41:57,332
<i>Just one look at you,
And a melody springs to life</i>

1847
01:41:57,333 --> 01:42:01,540
<i>You've descended like an angel
Just fold your wings</i>

1848
01:42:01,541 --> 01:42:05,832
<i>Let's stand by each other
For a lifetime</i>

1849
01:42:05,833 --> 01:42:10,249
<i>Your cheeks are flushed with a deep,
Timeless crimson</i>

1850
01:42:10,250 --> 01:42:14,625
<i>Your forehead shines with the deep,
Enduring red of kumkum</i>

1851
01:42:14,875 --> 01:42:19,125
<i>Our girl is quite a handful
She won't let anyone have it easy</i>

1852
01:42:19,333 --> 01:42:23,500
<i>Our boy is a gem,
So cherish and protect him</i>

1853
01:42:23,666 --> 01:42:27,791
<i>She walks in, radiant as jasmine
And magical in her bridal finery</i>

1854
01:42:28,000 --> 01:42:30,583
<i>Wherever she sets foot, flowers blossom</i>

1855
01:42:30,708 --> 01:42:32,833
<i>She's the little darling
Everyone praises</i>

1856
01:42:33,166 --> 01:42:37,000
<i>My darling, my treasure
You are as soothing as sandalwood</i>

1857
01:42:37,208 --> 01:42:41,416
<i>Your very being drips with sweetness
You're a bundle of beauty</i>

1858
01:42:42,041 --> 01:42:46,124
<i>My golden one,
Just wait until night falls</i>

1859
01:42:46,125 --> 01:42:50,416
<i>Even a lion turns into a little mouse,
Circling only around you</i>

1860
01:43:26,541 --> 01:43:30,791
<i>I'll give you every star in the sky</i>

1861
01:43:30,916 --> 01:43:35,332
<i>Give me that forelock
That grazes your brow</i>

1862
01:43:35,333 --> 01:43:39,708
<i>Even all the care you show me
Can never satisfy my longing</i>

1863
01:43:39,875 --> 01:43:44,083
<i>She stands beside me,
Grazing me like royalty</i>

1864
01:43:44,333 --> 01:43:46,250
<i>You bewitching beauty</i>

1865
01:43:46,500 --> 01:43:48,625
<i>Your smile leaves me love-struck</i>

1866
01:43:48,791 --> 01:43:52,916
<i>You're as sweet as a laddu,
Covered in beauty spots</i>

1867
01:43:53,208 --> 01:43:57,125
<i>My darling, my treasure
You are as soothing as sandalwood</i>

1868
01:43:57,291 --> 01:44:01,500
<i>Your very being drips with sweetness
You're a bundle of beauty</i>

1869
01:44:02,041 --> 01:44:06,082
<i>My golden one,
Just wait until night falls</i>

1870
01:44:06,083 --> 01:44:10,333
<i>Even a lion turns into a little mouse,
Circling only around you</i>

1871
01:44:50,750 --> 01:44:52,916
Look at this handsome boy.

1872
01:44:53,375 --> 01:44:55,582
Where are you going, son?

1873
01:44:55,583 --> 01:44:58,540
- Stand in one place.
- My dear boy.

1874
01:44:58,541 --> 01:44:59,540
What happened?

1875
01:44:59,541 --> 01:45:01,416
Such a beautiful boy.

1876
01:45:02,833 --> 01:45:03,750
Come!

1877
01:45:05,166 --> 01:45:07,500
What happened?
Where are you going?

1878
01:45:09,291 --> 01:45:12,208
Remember the <i>pani puri</i> shop
next to the coaching class?

1879
01:45:14,166 --> 01:45:15,416
Yeah, I remember.

1880
01:45:16,291 --> 01:45:18,166
I feel like having their <i>pani puri</i>.

1881
01:45:20,500 --> 01:45:22,500
Who would go all the way to Trichy
just to have <i>pani puri</i>?

1882
01:45:23,458 --> 01:45:24,375
I will go!

1883
01:45:24,833 --> 01:45:25,791
Ah, sorry!

1884
01:45:28,083 --> 01:45:30,458
Idhaya, if you see anyone coming,
give me a signal.

1885
01:45:30,583 --> 01:45:31,500
Okay.

1886
01:45:39,083 --> 01:45:40,000
Sam!

1887
01:45:41,083 --> 01:45:42,666
I too feel like having <i>pani puri</i>.

1888
01:45:53,333 --> 01:45:54,999
- Hi, brother, how are you?
- I'm good.

1889
01:45:55,000 --> 01:45:56,791
- Your shop looks different now.
- Yes, son.

1890
01:46:03,500 --> 01:46:06,957
- Super!
- I thought you said two would be enough.

1891
01:46:06,958 --> 01:46:08,624
Sriram, why did you
join the coaching class?

1892
01:46:08,625 --> 01:46:09,790
Aren't you here for Pradeepa?

1893
01:46:09,791 --> 01:46:13,166
The classes will end in two weeks.
When will you tell her?

1894
01:46:22,208 --> 01:46:24,500
<i>Oh, baby,
You be taking my breath away</i>

1895
01:46:24,916 --> 01:46:27,666
<i>Hey, come on, come here</i>

1896
01:46:28,041 --> 01:46:29,833
<i>I'll keep knockin' your door</i>

1897
01:46:30,666 --> 01:46:32,624
<i>Are you the gift fate gave me?</i>

1898
01:46:32,625 --> 01:46:34,708
<i>Oh, baby,
You be taking my breath away</i>

1899
01:46:35,125 --> 01:46:37,291
<i>Hey, come on, come here</i>

1900
01:46:37,458 --> 01:46:40,000
<i>Until I really feel
The thrill of first love</i>

1901
01:46:40,916 --> 01:46:43,041
<i>Are you the gift fate gave me?</i>

1902
01:46:44,791 --> 01:46:45,791
What are you looking for?

1903
01:46:46,458 --> 01:46:47,916
I had carved my name.

1904
01:46:48,833 --> 01:46:50,958
- Was that your bench?
- Yes.

1905
01:47:07,750 --> 01:47:09,083
You get up.

1906
01:47:10,250 --> 01:47:11,708
Yeah, you! Stand up!

1907
01:47:12,208 --> 01:47:13,125
Get up! Get up!

1908
01:47:14,541 --> 01:47:15,832
State Newton's second law.

1909
01:47:15,833 --> 01:47:18,958
Acceleration of an object
is directly proportional to its net force.

1910
01:47:19,083 --> 01:47:22,082
F=ma

1911
01:47:22,083 --> 01:47:23,666
How come you still remember it?

1912
01:47:24,833 --> 01:47:27,166
I studied hard.
How could I forget?

1913
01:47:37,750 --> 01:47:39,541
I didn't know you liked <i>pani puri</i> so much.

1914
01:47:39,916 --> 01:47:43,250
Come to Chennai. I'll take you
to Sowcarpet and buy you lots of it.

1915
01:47:44,083 --> 01:47:45,041
<i>Pani puri?</i>

1916
01:47:46,500 --> 01:47:47,666
I have a flight to catch tomorrow.

1917
01:47:48,250 --> 01:47:49,208
I'm heading back to the US.

1918
01:47:50,375 --> 01:47:52,666
- Not sure when I'll return.
- Tomorrow?

1919
01:47:52,958 --> 01:47:53,875
Yeah!

1920
01:47:56,416 --> 01:47:59,291
Hey, wait.
There are missed calls from Dad.

1921
01:48:15,250 --> 01:48:17,291
Idhaya, it's getting late.
Let's go!

1922
01:48:28,583 --> 01:48:31,208
<i>- Hey, groomsmen, where are you guys?</i>
- We're at the office. You?

1923
01:48:31,583 --> 01:48:32,582
<i>I'm at the Chennai airport.</i>

1924
01:48:32,583 --> 01:48:34,500
Why are you always at an airport?

1925
01:48:34,666 --> 01:48:37,165
<i>Stop kidding.
Sam is leaving for America.</i>

1926
01:48:37,166 --> 01:48:38,665
<i>So we came to send her off.</i>

1927
01:48:38,666 --> 01:48:41,291
You own a THAR SUV,
but you're driving it like a cab.

1928
01:48:41,583 --> 01:48:43,124
After dropping her off,
come to the office.

1929
01:48:43,125 --> 01:48:44,083
<i>Sure!</i>

1930
01:48:47,875 --> 01:48:49,541
- I want to go to the airport.
- Why airport?

1931
01:48:49,750 --> 01:48:51,791
Brother said he will come here.
Why should we go?

1932
01:48:55,041 --> 01:48:56,666
- I'm in love with Sam.
- Hey!

1933
01:48:57,125 --> 01:48:59,458
- Why suddenly?
- It's not sudden!

1934
01:49:00,125 --> 01:49:02,750
Why would I meet her and hang out
in Madurai after so many years?

1935
01:49:05,333 --> 01:49:07,208
Everything in life happens for a reason.

1936
01:49:09,583 --> 01:49:10,750
If I miss this chance…

1937
01:49:11,458 --> 01:49:13,708
I don't think
I will get another chance to tell her.

1938
01:49:14,291 --> 01:49:15,708
That's not what I meant.
But all of a sudden…

1939
01:49:17,583 --> 01:49:19,541
I cannot repeat the same mistake.

1940
01:49:22,166 --> 01:49:24,415
- Hey, we're coming along.
- Dude, wait for us.

1941
01:49:24,416 --> 01:49:25,791
Check how long until the flight leaves.

1942
01:49:27,166 --> 01:49:28,958
There's an hour left.

1943
01:49:30,916 --> 01:49:32,541
Hey, will you surely propose to her?

1944
01:49:34,541 --> 01:49:35,541
I will propose to her.

1945
01:49:35,666 --> 01:49:37,416
We have an hour left.
We'll arrive on time.

1946
01:49:37,541 --> 01:49:38,915
Sir, there's so much space here.

1947
01:49:38,916 --> 01:49:41,540
You could walk on the side. Why are you
shoving me? Which office do you work in?

1948
01:49:41,541 --> 01:49:44,083
Hey! There are many leaders
and politicians in the city.

1949
01:49:44,250 --> 01:49:46,999
You spare them all
but you're publishing news about my Chief.

1950
01:49:47,000 --> 01:49:47,915
Hey! I ought to!

1951
01:49:47,916 --> 01:49:49,750
What a timing. Oh, no!

1952
01:49:50,000 --> 01:49:51,375
Sir, I'm sorry.

1953
01:49:51,625 --> 01:49:52,625
I know who sent you.

1954
01:49:52,750 --> 01:49:55,582
I'm aware of why you are here.
But I'm urgently heading to the airport.

1955
01:49:55,583 --> 01:49:57,000
I'll be back in two hours.
Then, we'll discuss it.

1956
01:49:57,125 --> 01:49:58,040
Why don't you wait upstairs?

1957
01:49:58,041 --> 01:50:00,415
Hey, do we look like an auto
or taxi to put us on wait?

1958
01:50:00,416 --> 01:50:01,499
Sir, just give me two hours.

1959
01:50:01,500 --> 01:50:02,958
Hey, I want justice for my chief!

1960
01:50:03,208 --> 01:50:04,624
Sir, please go upstairs and sit.

1961
01:50:04,625 --> 01:50:06,290
Hey, what's your problem?

1962
01:50:06,291 --> 01:50:08,041
Excuse me,
how do I get to Accenture office?

1963
01:50:08,250 --> 01:50:09,291
- Sir, one minute.
- Hey!

1964
01:50:09,416 --> 01:50:10,832
- Hey!
- Accenture isn't here.

1965
01:50:10,833 --> 01:50:12,708
- You must head to that side.
- Not that side. But this side.

1966
01:50:12,875 --> 01:50:14,540
How is it even on this side?

1967
01:50:14,541 --> 01:50:16,207
- Sir, which way did you enter?
- Hey, hop in!

1968
01:50:16,208 --> 01:50:19,040
- Hop in, damn it!
- Hey, don't let them escape.

1969
01:50:19,041 --> 01:50:20,582
Hey, stop! Catch him!

1970
01:50:20,583 --> 01:50:21,791
Hey, start the car!

1971
01:50:25,625 --> 01:50:26,541
Catch him!

1972
01:50:37,333 --> 01:50:39,707
Hey, don't you have any road sense?

1973
01:50:39,708 --> 01:50:40,624
Step out of the car.

1974
01:50:40,625 --> 01:50:41,999
- Sir, sir, sir, sorry, sir.
- Step out of the car.

1975
01:50:42,000 --> 01:50:42,915
Sir, I'm sorry.

1976
01:50:42,916 --> 01:50:44,290
- Look, what have you done?
- Dude, you handle it.

1977
01:50:44,291 --> 01:50:46,040
- Go, catch them.
- Prabhu, you handle it.

1978
01:50:46,041 --> 01:50:47,499
Guys, you leave. I'll handle it.

1979
01:50:47,500 --> 01:50:48,416
Fine, handle him.

1980
01:50:48,708 --> 01:50:50,333
Look at yourself. Stop, damn it!

1981
01:50:50,708 --> 01:50:52,000
Hey, where are you going?
Stop!

1982
01:51:02,583 --> 01:51:04,250
Hey, how did you get in?

1983
01:51:04,500 --> 01:51:06,208
- Brother, is the bus going to the airport?
- Yes!

1984
01:51:06,416 --> 01:51:07,374
Take your seat.

1985
01:51:07,375 --> 01:51:08,833
- Super!
- Hey, who are you guys?

1986
01:51:09,208 --> 01:51:11,040
I'm a Shardul Thakur fan.

1987
01:51:11,041 --> 01:51:13,124
- Yes!
- Does he even have fans?

1988
01:51:13,125 --> 01:51:14,165
CSK runs in my blood.

1989
01:51:14,166 --> 01:51:16,249
If you slit his hands
he will bleed yellow.

1990
01:51:16,250 --> 01:51:18,915
Hey, you guys step off the bus
and do whatever you want.

1991
01:51:18,916 --> 01:51:20,916
Step off the bus
or else they'll fire me.

1992
01:51:21,083 --> 01:51:22,750
Brother, you'd only lose your job.

1993
01:51:22,875 --> 01:51:24,249
But my friend would lose his life.

1994
01:51:24,250 --> 01:51:25,416
It's a matter of love.

1995
01:51:25,625 --> 01:51:26,541
Love?

1996
01:51:44,750 --> 01:51:46,499
Hey, who's kissing the bonnet?

1997
01:51:46,500 --> 01:51:47,416
- Mumbai Indians, bro.
- Hey!

1998
01:51:47,958 --> 01:51:49,625
- Brother, eyes on the road!
- Oh, no!

1999
01:52:12,958 --> 01:52:15,332
Sir, he's a CSK fan.
Please spare him.

2000
01:52:15,333 --> 01:52:18,040
Hey, you proved
that you're a Shardul Thakur fan.

2001
01:52:18,041 --> 01:52:20,333
- You're getting thrashed.
- Please drive faster.

2002
01:52:49,000 --> 01:52:52,958
Hey, he's hanging like garlands
on a pilgrimage bus.

2003
01:53:07,125 --> 01:53:08,041
That's enough.

2004
01:53:11,833 --> 01:53:12,875
- Happy journey.
- Thank you.

2005
01:53:14,458 --> 01:53:17,791
Brother, he curled up
after getting thrashed by us.

2006
01:53:17,916 --> 01:53:19,333
Where do I bring him?

2007
01:53:37,250 --> 01:53:39,458
Hey, lift him.

2008
01:53:51,916 --> 01:53:54,083
CSK may be at the bottom
of the point table.

2009
01:53:54,208 --> 01:53:57,416
But suddenly, it'll shift to top gear
and move up.

2010
01:54:06,166 --> 01:54:07,582
Hey, we've arrived at the airport.

2011
01:54:07,583 --> 01:54:09,000
When are you going to finish the game?

2012
01:54:09,250 --> 01:54:11,333
Wait! Let me end it right away.

2013
01:54:13,041 --> 01:54:15,290
They already thrashed
and stuck him to the bonnet.

2014
01:54:15,291 --> 01:54:16,500
Yet he's determined to fight.

2015
01:54:26,750 --> 01:54:27,666
Stop it!

2016
01:54:27,958 --> 01:54:28,875
Buddy!

2017
01:54:29,833 --> 01:54:31,708
Stop it! You might kill him.

2018
01:54:32,583 --> 01:54:34,000
We're getting late for the flight.

2019
01:54:34,791 --> 01:54:36,665
They tore the bus seats.
I'm going to get fired.

2020
01:54:36,666 --> 01:54:37,874
I don't know what to do.

2021
01:54:37,875 --> 01:54:39,415
Hey, no, no!

2022
01:54:39,416 --> 01:54:42,000
Please don't record and post reels.
They'll fire me.

2023
01:54:52,083 --> 01:54:55,500
<i>Time came to a standstill</i>

2024
01:54:55,708 --> 01:54:58,291
<i>We've been stealing glances every day</i>

2025
01:54:58,458 --> 01:55:03,416
<i>My steps always find their way to you</i>

2026
01:55:03,875 --> 01:55:06,541
<i>Sleep has deserted me</i>

2027
01:55:06,708 --> 01:55:09,832
<i>My yearning keeps growing</i>

2028
01:55:09,833 --> 01:55:13,958
<i>My body trembles because of you,
My love</i>

2029
01:55:14,083 --> 01:55:16,875
<i>Hey, come on, come here</i>

2030
01:55:17,041 --> 01:55:19,666
<i>Are you the gift fate gave me?</i>

2031
01:55:19,833 --> 01:55:24,958
<i>Just your thoughts
Lift me off the ground</i>

2032
01:55:25,250 --> 01:55:27,916
<i>Just you… only you…</i>

2033
01:55:28,083 --> 01:55:30,750
<i>I'll stay by your side forever</i>

2034
01:55:30,875 --> 01:55:36,458
<i>You smile every day
Till your lips hurt</i>

2035
01:55:36,583 --> 01:55:39,458
<i>Oh, baby, you be taking my breath away
Pushing me far away</i>

2036
01:55:39,666 --> 01:55:42,582
<i>Making me drift away
Teasing me every day</i>

2037
01:55:42,583 --> 01:55:44,416
<i>I'll keep knockin' your door</i>

2038
01:55:45,541 --> 01:55:46,458
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

2039
01:55:47,666 --> 01:55:50,708
Idhaya, what are you doing?

2040
01:55:51,791 --> 01:55:56,625
<i>An unspoken love, raging within</i>

2041
01:55:57,333 --> 01:56:02,125
<i>An endless quest,
A heart filled with unrest</i>

2042
01:56:02,833 --> 01:56:07,583
<i>Will this wound ever heal
If we stay silent?</i>

2043
01:56:08,416 --> 01:56:13,416
<i>Will I overcome my shyness?
Will love prevail?</i>

2044
01:56:17,500 --> 01:56:21,166
<i>I'm still clueless about why
I ran onto the runway like a madman.</i>

2045
01:56:21,833 --> 01:56:24,083
<i>Perhaps I didn't want
to miss another opportunity with her.</i>

2046
01:56:24,625 --> 01:56:28,041
<i>But one good thing that came out of it
was that Juju came back into my life.</i>

2047
01:56:28,583 --> 01:56:31,291
<i>I thought my feelings for her
ended after that.</i>

2048
01:56:31,958 --> 01:56:34,708
<i>After that, back to square one.</i>

2049
01:56:36,166 --> 01:56:38,583
<i>My uncle was afraid
I would end up alone like him.</i>

2050
01:56:38,791 --> 01:56:41,375
<i>That's why he kept
insisting that I get married.</i>

2051
01:56:46,250 --> 01:56:47,208
<i>But then one day…</i>

2052
01:56:47,541 --> 01:56:49,500
{\an8}<i>I realized that she was beyond my reach.</i>

2053
01:56:54,833 --> 01:56:56,041
Hey, hey, hey, stop it!

2054
01:56:56,333 --> 01:56:57,916
Stop it! I am done!

2055
01:56:58,500 --> 01:57:01,333
- He's never going to propose.
- Sir, where are you going?

2056
01:57:01,625 --> 01:57:02,541
What do you expect?

2057
01:57:02,875 --> 01:57:04,916
I've been waiting for him
to propose at least once,

2058
01:57:05,083 --> 01:57:06,166
but he is not doing it.

2059
01:57:06,500 --> 01:57:07,416
Thrash him, sir.

2060
01:57:07,958 --> 01:57:10,875
Sir, you made it till here.
Please listen to the rest of the story.

2061
01:57:11,041 --> 01:57:11,958
It'll be terrific!

2062
01:57:12,500 --> 01:57:13,416
Another love?

2063
01:57:14,000 --> 01:57:15,665
- I can't bear it anymore. Spare me.
- Please, sir.

2064
01:57:15,666 --> 01:57:17,415
Sir, it's not another love story.

2065
01:57:17,416 --> 01:57:18,791
- He's getting engaged.
- Yes, sir.

2066
01:57:19,166 --> 01:57:21,458
- Engagement? Engagement?
- Yes, sir.

2067
01:57:21,833 --> 01:57:22,916
You never mentioned it.

2068
01:57:23,791 --> 01:57:27,290
I was expecting another tragedy
like the film <i>Punnagai Mannan</i>.

2069
01:57:27,291 --> 01:57:28,958
- Girl, please make me a drink.
- Plus one!

2070
01:57:30,708 --> 01:57:32,540
{\an8}<i>We all convinced him somehow.</i>

2071
01:57:32,541 --> 01:57:35,790
{\an8}<i>As per Uncle's wish,
we got him engaged to Adhithi.</i>

2072
01:57:35,791 --> 01:57:37,750
<i>He too accepted it and moved on.</i>

2073
01:58:03,208 --> 01:58:04,208
Hey, stop it!

2074
01:58:05,583 --> 01:58:07,415
Hey, at least wear shades
before checking girls out.

2075
01:58:07,416 --> 01:58:08,791
- It's so evident you're looking.
- Is it?

2076
01:58:09,041 --> 01:58:11,041
Here you go.
Where's your wife?

2077
01:58:11,625 --> 01:58:13,332
She's putting on makeup.

2078
01:58:13,333 --> 01:58:15,708
The engagement is over.
What is she getting ready for now?

2079
01:58:16,083 --> 01:58:17,582
Let her take her sweet time.
Let it go.

2080
01:58:17,583 --> 01:58:18,583
Sounds good!

2081
01:58:19,000 --> 01:58:21,958
I am confused if he's happy or sad.

2082
01:58:22,166 --> 01:58:24,583
He keeps an expression that
fits all kinds of background scores.

2083
01:58:25,166 --> 01:58:26,416
- Something is wrong.
- Hey...

2084
01:58:26,541 --> 01:58:29,166
He's doing well. Don't mess it up.

2085
01:58:29,500 --> 01:58:31,791
- I feel something's wrong.
- I too feel the same.

2086
01:58:32,000 --> 01:58:32,958
Let's ask him.

2087
01:58:34,916 --> 01:58:36,541
Hey, all okay?

2088
01:58:37,500 --> 01:58:38,500
Yeah, all okay.

2089
01:58:38,916 --> 01:58:39,916
All okay, it seems.

2090
01:58:40,125 --> 01:58:42,207
He's fine.
But you guys are confusing him.

2091
01:58:42,208 --> 01:58:43,208
What's the secret?

2092
01:58:43,666 --> 01:58:46,375
You see, a lot of your friends
have come down from Bangalore.

2093
01:58:46,500 --> 01:58:48,666
We're friends. They're friends, too.

2094
01:58:48,791 --> 01:58:50,874
If all the friends mingle…

2095
01:58:50,875 --> 01:58:52,540
I hope you understood.

2096
01:58:52,541 --> 01:58:54,875
But aren't you married?

2097
01:58:55,250 --> 01:58:56,915
He got married.
I never got married.

2098
01:58:56,916 --> 01:58:57,916
We two are bachelors!

2099
01:58:58,041 --> 01:58:59,624
- They are both single.
- Idhaya, please tell her.

2100
01:58:59,625 --> 01:59:00,750
They aren't married.

2101
01:59:00,875 --> 01:59:02,250
I only got married once.

2102
01:59:07,833 --> 01:59:08,999
<i>- Hey, Idhaya!</i>
- Hi, Adhithi.

2103
01:59:09,000 --> 01:59:10,416
<i>- Have you reached?</i>
- I reached.

2104
01:59:10,666 --> 01:59:12,540
<i>- Where exactly are you?</i>
- I'm right here. Where are you?

2105
01:59:12,541 --> 01:59:13,665
<i>I'm just parking my car.</i>

2106
01:59:13,666 --> 01:59:15,165
<i>- You?</i>
- I'm on the first floor.

2107
01:59:15,166 --> 01:59:16,249
<i>Super, I'll see you there.</i>

2108
01:59:16,250 --> 01:59:17,166
Idhaya!

2109
01:59:41,125 --> 01:59:42,375
What a surprise!

2110
01:59:43,541 --> 01:59:45,166
It's been years
since we last saw each other.

2111
01:59:49,625 --> 01:59:50,541
How are you?

2112
01:59:51,916 --> 01:59:53,333
Oh, my God! Look at you.

2113
01:59:53,500 --> 01:59:54,833
You've changed a lot, Idhaya.

2114
01:59:55,500 --> 01:59:57,125
Are you still in touch
with your college friends?

2115
01:59:57,458 --> 01:59:59,833
Sachin, Lado, Prabhu, Dravid…

2116
02:00:00,166 --> 02:00:02,333
Those days were a lot of fun.

2117
02:00:03,458 --> 02:00:05,375
Sorry, I couldn't keep in touch.

2118
02:00:05,916 --> 02:00:07,083
I miss those days.

2119
02:00:08,083 --> 02:00:09,041
How are you?

2120
02:00:09,708 --> 02:00:10,707
I'm doing well.

2121
02:00:10,708 --> 02:00:12,041
I now work at Delhi AIMS.

2122
02:00:12,166 --> 02:00:13,833
I came to Chennai to attend a conference.

2123
02:00:15,541 --> 02:00:18,041
I never expected to run into you.

2124
02:00:21,000 --> 02:00:22,291
Did you get married?

2125
02:00:23,416 --> 02:00:25,125
Not yet. But going to.

2126
02:00:27,041 --> 02:00:28,458
You haven't changed, Idhaya.

2127
02:00:29,125 --> 02:00:30,208
You're still the same.

2128
02:00:30,541 --> 02:00:32,291
A man of few words. Silent.

2129
02:00:32,500 --> 02:00:33,416
You're the same!

2130
02:00:37,791 --> 02:00:39,958
Anyway, I'm leaving.

2131
02:00:41,083 --> 02:00:42,000
I'll see you.

2132
02:00:42,708 --> 02:00:43,625
Bye.

2133
02:01:09,791 --> 02:01:13,041
If you don't mind,
I want to tell you something.

2134
02:01:15,625 --> 02:01:17,416
Back in college…

2135
02:01:19,291 --> 02:01:20,583
I was in love with you.

2136
02:01:25,083 --> 02:01:28,500
But I didn't know
if you felt the same way about me.

2137
02:01:29,041 --> 02:01:32,583
With the fear of rejection,
I could not confess my love.

2138
02:01:39,208 --> 02:01:41,708
<i>I was planning to tell you
at the railway station.</i>

2139
02:01:41,833 --> 02:01:43,166
<i>But I couldn't do it.</i>

2140
02:02:07,750 --> 02:02:08,666
But now…

2141
02:02:10,208 --> 02:02:11,625
I feel very happy.

2142
02:02:16,166 --> 02:02:17,333
Don't get me wrong.

2143
02:02:18,916 --> 02:02:20,083
I'm happily married.

2144
02:02:20,583 --> 02:02:22,208
I have two beautiful kids.

2145
02:02:23,875 --> 02:02:24,958
It's just that…

2146
02:02:27,375 --> 02:02:29,041
I felt like telling you.

2147
02:02:32,958 --> 02:02:34,333
And I'm glad I could.

2148
02:02:37,208 --> 02:02:38,041
I'm okay!

2149
02:02:38,666 --> 02:02:39,583
Bye!

2150
02:02:40,125 --> 02:02:43,875
Please don't forget to invite me
for your wedding.

2151
02:02:50,916 --> 02:02:53,083
Fine! Bye, Idhaya.

2152
02:02:54,041 --> 02:02:54,958
Bye!

2153
02:03:19,250 --> 02:03:20,541
{\an8}- <i>Hello?
- Lado, listen.</i>

2154
02:03:20,916 --> 02:03:22,333
<i>I'm coming to the US to meet Sam.</i>

2155
02:03:22,458 --> 02:03:23,790
Are you even in your senses?

2156
02:03:23,791 --> 02:03:26,000
You're about to get married.
Why would you do something like this?

2157
02:03:26,958 --> 02:03:31,166
The pain of rejection is nothing compared
to the pain of leaving your love unspoken.

2158
02:03:31,708 --> 02:03:34,000
Didn't you say that you
got to fight for your love?

2159
02:03:34,500 --> 02:03:36,333
I'm not in a situation to fight.

2160
02:03:37,500 --> 02:03:39,041
Even if I did,
it won't be the right thing to do.

2161
02:03:39,250 --> 02:03:41,583
At least let me speak my heart out.

2162
02:03:42,791 --> 02:03:45,874
Are you going to say
"you loved her" or "in love with her?"

2163
02:03:45,875 --> 02:03:47,915
Why are you asking me?
Ask Adhithi's family about it.

2164
02:03:47,916 --> 02:03:50,458
Call her father.
Instead, you're calling me.

2165
02:03:50,750 --> 02:03:52,791
Hey, I asked you a question.

2166
02:03:57,750 --> 02:03:59,583
- Hey, Senthil, come here.
<i>- Hey, are you there?</i>

2167
02:03:59,708 --> 02:04:00,625
<i>Hello?</i>

2168
02:04:01,166 --> 02:04:02,250
I'm going to say, "I loved her."

2169
02:04:02,833 --> 02:04:04,041
She's now my past, Lado.

2170
02:04:05,708 --> 02:04:09,166
If you think you'd feel better
after speaking your heart out,

2171
02:04:10,208 --> 02:04:11,875
then come over here.
We'll handle it.

2172
02:04:12,250 --> 02:04:13,166
Now, you say?

2173
02:04:13,375 --> 02:04:16,250
No! Get married to Adhithi
and bring her too.

2174
02:04:16,416 --> 02:04:17,874
Then you can tell her
"love you" together.

2175
02:04:17,875 --> 02:04:18,791
Come soon!

2176
02:04:19,958 --> 02:04:22,125
The wedding is in 10 days.
What excuse can I make?

2177
02:04:23,000 --> 02:04:25,541
You have your bachelor party.
Use that as an excuse.

2178
02:04:25,708 --> 02:04:27,291
Everyone will be
more than happy to come along.

2179
02:04:27,458 --> 02:04:29,458
I will handle the rest.
You just come.

2180
02:04:56,583 --> 02:04:58,999
Hey, don't make strong drinks
and get him sloshed.

2181
02:04:59,000 --> 02:05:01,750
- We have a lot of work to do.
- My mixing is perfect, dude.

2182
02:05:02,208 --> 02:05:03,125
Uncle!

2183
02:05:04,125 --> 02:05:05,582
I will ask you something.
Don't get worked up.

2184
02:05:05,583 --> 02:05:07,916
You first ask. Then I'll decide
whether to get worked up or not.

2185
02:05:08,083 --> 02:05:09,208
Uncle, here's your drink.

2186
02:05:11,875 --> 02:05:13,791
- Guys are asking for a bachelor party.
- Go ahead, throw one.

2187
02:05:14,041 --> 02:05:14,958
Take them away.

2188
02:05:15,958 --> 02:05:16,958
Not here, but in the US.

2189
02:05:17,208 --> 02:05:19,291
Do you mean
the United States of America?

2190
02:05:19,791 --> 02:05:21,457
I will return two days before the wedding.

2191
02:05:21,458 --> 02:05:22,916
- You want to go?
- Yes, Uncle.

2192
02:05:23,583 --> 02:05:24,832
Take permission from Adhithi.

2193
02:05:24,833 --> 02:05:26,166
Why should I ask for her permission?

2194
02:05:26,291 --> 02:05:28,832
Go to her. She's going to be your wife.
You need her permission.

2195
02:05:28,833 --> 02:05:30,582
- You tell me, Uncle.
- Don't feel shy.

2196
02:05:30,583 --> 02:05:32,333
Go and get her permission.

2197
02:05:32,916 --> 02:05:34,958
- What is this, Uncle?
- Go ahead! Stop thinking.

2198
02:05:35,250 --> 02:05:37,291
Idhaya, I don't have a passport.

2199
02:05:37,500 --> 02:05:38,750
Why don't we go to Goa?

2200
02:05:39,166 --> 02:05:40,083
Hey, get lost!

2201
02:05:40,708 --> 02:05:43,333
Go have a fun trip.
You don't need my permission.

2202
02:05:44,375 --> 02:05:46,125
We will be returning only
two days before the wedding.

2203
02:05:46,291 --> 02:05:48,957
I was checking as it'll be
a close call to the wedding.

2204
02:05:48,958 --> 02:05:49,875
We can manage.

2205
02:05:50,875 --> 02:05:52,416
- Hi, Dad.
- What is the son-in-law saying?

2206
02:05:52,791 --> 02:05:54,458
You see, I was telling her…

2207
02:05:54,708 --> 02:05:56,332
There's a business deal happening
in America.

2208
02:05:56,333 --> 02:05:58,457
Trump has given him
an appointment to meet.

2209
02:05:58,458 --> 02:05:59,499
Oh!

2210
02:05:59,500 --> 02:06:01,250
He is asking if it is right
to go with the wedding close by.

2211
02:06:02,000 --> 02:06:03,916
Trump, right?
Please go and meet him.

2212
02:06:04,041 --> 02:06:05,208
You will return
before the wedding, right?

2213
02:06:05,333 --> 02:06:07,541
- I will, Father-in-law.
- Then go ahead.

2214
02:06:07,916 --> 02:06:09,125
Why do you look stunned?

2215
02:06:09,541 --> 02:06:11,582
Trump, he says.
It's usual in politics.

2216
02:06:11,583 --> 02:06:13,958
Listen, when he returns from the US…

2217
02:06:14,125 --> 02:06:16,874
Print a banner, "The Minister's son-in-law
is returning after meeting Trump."

2218
02:06:16,875 --> 02:06:18,458
- This is usual in politics as well.
- Right!

2219
02:06:18,708 --> 02:06:19,916
You guys carry on.

2220
02:06:22,958 --> 02:06:23,875
Thanks.

2221
02:06:28,375 --> 02:06:29,416
I'll miss you, Idhaya.

2222
02:06:32,916 --> 02:06:34,291
You guys are such close friends.

2223
02:06:34,750 --> 02:06:36,583
At least you guys could've
helped him confess his love.

2224
02:06:38,166 --> 02:06:41,708
You're right. Had I helped him,
it wouldn't have been a problem now.

2225
02:06:42,250 --> 02:06:44,375
Now, you realize.
Tomorrow he's getting married.

2226
02:06:44,541 --> 02:06:45,458
Go to sleep.

2227
02:06:46,125 --> 02:06:48,041
I'm going to sleep.

2228
02:07:05,041 --> 02:07:06,833
Looks like someone hasn't moved on.

2229
02:07:08,791 --> 02:07:10,791
He's not worth that right now.

2230
02:07:11,041 --> 02:07:12,500
I'm just a nice person, you know.

2231
02:07:14,666 --> 02:07:17,624
Sir, do you know
what happened in America?

2232
02:07:17,625 --> 02:07:19,665
Hey, I'll throw you out of the plane.

2233
02:07:19,666 --> 02:07:21,125
- Shut up and sleep.
- Okay, sir.

2234
02:07:25,125 --> 02:07:27,916
Bro, close your eyes and sleep for a bit.

2235
02:07:28,583 --> 02:07:30,666
No matter what,
only good things will happen.

2236
02:07:31,333 --> 02:07:32,250
Sleep.

2237
02:07:44,083 --> 02:07:46,625
Hey, what did you say
happened in America?

2238
02:08:07,291 --> 02:08:09,833
From what I'm hearing,
I don't think we're returning to India.

2239
02:08:10,500 --> 02:08:12,958
I had a doubt when you brought us out
so far for the bachelor party.

2240
02:08:13,208 --> 02:08:15,000
That you must've done something.

2241
02:08:15,333 --> 02:08:19,666
I get a feeling that he's here to convert
his Aadhaar Card into a Green Card.

2242
02:08:19,833 --> 02:08:22,333
What's the purpose of telling her
that you loved her?

2243
02:08:22,583 --> 02:08:23,500
You're right!

2244
02:08:24,875 --> 02:08:27,666
I don't know. It's been pricking
my conscience for a while now.

2245
02:08:29,166 --> 02:08:31,250
That too after Amudha spoke to me…

2246
02:08:31,708 --> 02:08:32,875
The feeling became stronger.

2247
02:08:36,708 --> 02:08:40,375
When a married woman mustered
the courage to speak her heart…

2248
02:08:41,041 --> 02:08:44,666
I cannot keep this locked in my heart,
get married, and lead a new life.

2249
02:08:46,000 --> 02:08:47,125
For two days, leave me alone.

2250
02:08:48,791 --> 02:08:49,833
I'll meet Sam…

2251
02:08:50,500 --> 02:08:52,041
If I tell her, I'd feel light, guys.

2252
02:08:54,041 --> 02:08:56,500
At the end of the day, it's still
my bachelor's party, so have fun.

2253
02:08:56,625 --> 02:08:57,875
- Correct!
- Okay!

2254
02:08:58,583 --> 02:09:00,708
We're convinced.
Let's enjoy the trip.

2255
02:10:02,166 --> 02:10:03,083
Hi!

2256
02:10:06,416 --> 02:10:07,333
Wait, I'll come out.

2257
02:10:08,083 --> 02:10:10,000
Tell me, what are you doing here?

2258
02:10:11,458 --> 02:10:14,291
I am here on a small business trip.

2259
02:10:14,916 --> 02:10:16,125
At NASA?

2260
02:10:16,875 --> 02:10:18,041
I have a meeting in New York.

2261
02:10:18,875 --> 02:10:21,125
I had some time to kill,
so I came to look around NASA.

2262
02:10:22,041 --> 02:10:22,958
Not bad!

2263
02:10:23,416 --> 02:10:25,791
Are you interested in NASA and astronomy?

2264
02:10:26,666 --> 02:10:27,583
It's all because of you.

2265
02:10:28,541 --> 02:10:29,458
Oh, oh!

2266
02:10:32,208 --> 02:10:35,166
Since school, you've shown
interest in space, rocket science, etc.

2267
02:10:35,916 --> 02:10:38,416
Back then,
I thought you lied about it.

2268
02:10:39,333 --> 02:10:41,833
But not bad.
You've come a long way, Sam.

2269
02:10:43,333 --> 02:10:44,250
Thank you.

2270
02:10:44,750 --> 02:10:48,333
You know, it's been six months
since I saw a known face.

2271
02:10:49,250 --> 02:10:51,583
Seeing you here feels like
I traveled to Madurai.

2272
02:10:53,750 --> 02:10:55,416
Suddenly, I'm missing everyone.

2273
02:10:57,875 --> 02:10:59,250
Maybe that's why I'm here.

2274
02:11:01,541 --> 02:11:02,458
What did you say?

2275
02:11:03,500 --> 02:11:04,416
Nothing!

2276
02:11:06,541 --> 02:11:08,333
Don't you use this rocket
for your missions?

2277
02:11:12,125 --> 02:11:13,625
We just returned from a mission.

2278
02:11:13,791 --> 02:11:15,208
- Oh!
- So, we're on a break now.

2279
02:11:15,583 --> 02:11:17,791
We're currently conducting
Stem-Programs for students.

2280
02:11:18,416 --> 02:11:20,166
Wow! Super!

2281
02:11:26,958 --> 02:11:28,833
Actually,
I'll be visiting New York this weekend.

2282
02:11:29,041 --> 02:11:30,541
If you're free, we can catch up.

2283
02:11:35,000 --> 02:11:36,875
Unless you're with someone.

2284
02:11:37,708 --> 02:11:39,583
No, no! I'm here alone.

2285
02:11:40,875 --> 02:11:42,583
Okay! I'll see you in New York.

2286
02:12:08,125 --> 02:12:09,500
<i>O heart of mine</i>

2287
02:12:10,458 --> 02:12:12,666
<i>Are you the spark that sows love?</i>

2288
02:12:16,250 --> 02:12:20,291
<i>Your heart carries countless stories</i>

2289
02:12:24,125 --> 02:12:25,458
<i>O heart of mine</i>

2290
02:12:26,333 --> 02:12:28,708
<i>Are you the spark that sows love?</i>

2291
02:12:32,166 --> 02:12:36,375
<i>Your heart carries countless stories</i>

2292
02:12:39,083 --> 02:12:44,500
<i>Who are you, wayfarer?</i>

2293
02:12:47,083 --> 02:12:52,416
<i>You're but a passing traveler</i>

2294
02:12:55,166 --> 02:13:00,541
<i>Who are you, wayfarer?</i>

2295
02:13:03,125 --> 02:13:08,541
<i>You're but a passing traveler</i>

2296
02:13:43,750 --> 02:13:47,250
<i>Feet that won't take flight,
Eyes that cannot soar</i>

2297
02:13:47,541 --> 02:13:51,208
<i>Why soar across the sky
To reach the distant beyond?</i>

2298
02:13:51,583 --> 02:13:55,250
<i>Blooms unfold in every direction,
Filling the world with vibrant hues</i>

2299
02:13:55,541 --> 02:13:59,582
<i>Every path I find here
Sets my restless heart adrift</i>

2300
02:13:59,583 --> 02:14:02,875
<i>Hey, Idhaya,
Don't flutter like a butterfly</i>

2301
02:14:03,083 --> 02:14:07,166
<i>Hey, my heart,
Don't grow weary thinking about it</i>

2302
02:14:07,583 --> 02:14:11,249
<i>Don't lose yourself
Searching for what lies ahead</i>

2303
02:14:11,250 --> 02:14:15,500
<i>Idhaya, don't squander your happiness</i>

2304
02:14:16,291 --> 02:14:19,832
<i>What is it that you need?
Tell me, won't you?</i>

2305
02:14:19,833 --> 02:14:23,583
<i>Keep fighting,
And you'll make it yours</i>

2306
02:14:23,958 --> 02:14:27,291
<i>You're lightning itself
So why this heart of stone?</i>

2307
02:14:27,666 --> 02:14:31,458
<i>I left you and soared away,
Yet my heart was brought to its knees</i>

2308
02:14:31,833 --> 02:14:35,333
<i>You're going away
You're my very soul, aren't you?</i>

2309
02:14:51,708 --> 02:14:55,500
<i>Let my heart beat louder than ever</i>

2310
02:14:55,791 --> 02:14:59,375
<i>Let the dream lingering in my eyes
Fall into my hands</i>

2311
02:14:59,750 --> 02:15:03,583
<i>May this faltering heart tell our story</i>

2312
02:15:04,041 --> 02:15:07,958
<i>May everything in our lives
Unfold beautifully</i>

2313
02:15:23,250 --> 02:15:24,250
<i>O heart of mine...</i>

2314
02:15:44,833 --> 02:15:46,416
Hey, Sis, did you reach Chennai?

2315
02:15:47,083 --> 02:15:48,958
Yeah, I reached!
What are you up to?

2316
02:15:49,625 --> 02:15:50,625
I'm heading out.

2317
02:15:51,541 --> 02:15:52,500
Where are you heading?

2318
02:15:54,416 --> 02:15:55,375
To propose my love.

2319
02:15:57,833 --> 02:16:00,541
- Damn you, girl!
- I don't know if you remember.

2320
02:16:00,875 --> 02:16:03,958
He used to come to the same
coaching and tennis classes.

2321
02:16:04,458 --> 02:16:06,166
He even visited our house on our birthday.

2322
02:16:06,375 --> 02:16:08,083
- <i>Idhaya!</i>
- Oh, that guy!

2323
02:16:08,333 --> 02:16:10,291
He used to check me out at coaching class.

2324
02:16:11,166 --> 02:16:12,666
He would've checked you out,
thinking it was me.

2325
02:16:13,458 --> 02:16:16,208
How come suddenly you're in love?

2326
02:16:16,541 --> 02:16:18,333
It's not easy to impress you.

2327
02:16:20,666 --> 02:16:24,541
You know, when someone
keeps crossing paths in your life…

2328
02:16:24,791 --> 02:16:26,458
It may not be a coincidence.

2329
02:16:27,958 --> 02:16:29,375
I feel it's more than that.

2330
02:16:29,875 --> 02:16:32,041
These corny dialogues
don't work even in cinemas now.

2331
02:16:32,375 --> 02:16:33,375
Am I right, baby?

2332
02:16:34,083 --> 02:16:36,582
You're demotivating me.
I'm hanging up.

2333
02:16:36,583 --> 02:16:38,375
He's leaving tomorrow.
I must propose to him tonight.

2334
02:16:38,958 --> 02:16:40,625
- All the best.
- Thanks, Sis.

2335
02:16:47,083 --> 02:16:48,666
We postponed our tickets three times now.

2336
02:16:49,625 --> 02:16:51,583
Uncle has been calling me continuously.

2337
02:16:52,000 --> 02:16:54,625
Only if we leave tomorrow will it work.
If not, forget about your wedding.

2338
02:16:55,166 --> 02:16:56,583
Give me some time to think.

2339
02:16:56,958 --> 02:16:59,416
What are you thinking about?
What more do you want to think about?

2340
02:17:13,291 --> 02:17:15,833
You're feeling emotional,
as if it were a fresh proposal.

2341
02:17:16,625 --> 02:17:18,333
You're going to tell
that you loved her, right?

2342
02:17:18,458 --> 02:17:20,208
Or do you love her?

2343
02:17:20,583 --> 02:17:22,208
Hey, you promised me.

2344
02:17:22,875 --> 02:17:26,416
<i>Dude, this does not involve emotions.
You're here just to share information.</i>

2345
02:17:26,666 --> 02:17:27,583
<i>Bear that in mind.</i>

2346
02:17:28,000 --> 02:17:29,749
From the looks of it…

2347
02:17:29,750 --> 02:17:32,499
I feel it's not his past love
but his present love.

2348
02:17:32,500 --> 02:17:34,791
Hey, Prabhu, don't encourage him.

2349
02:17:35,000 --> 02:17:38,125
He's already engaged.
Who's going to explain to Adhithi?

2350
02:17:38,250 --> 02:17:41,125
<i>Only we're discussing it.
He's sitting here silently.</i>

2351
02:17:42,000 --> 02:17:43,958
Hey, open your mouth
and say something.

2352
02:17:44,375 --> 02:17:47,208
Dude, you hung out for ten days
with her to your heart's desire.

2353
02:17:47,333 --> 02:17:49,708
<i>Now don't go and propose to her.
That'll mess with her mind.</i>

2354
02:17:49,875 --> 02:17:51,249
<i>Your wedding is the day after.</i>

2355
02:17:51,250 --> 02:17:55,374
Dude, use inky-pinky-ponky and
choose who you'd want to live with.

2356
02:17:55,375 --> 02:17:57,125
He might do it.
Please shut up.

2357
02:17:58,625 --> 02:18:00,458
Will you all please stop talking?

2358
02:18:00,791 --> 02:18:03,583
Hey, first, do what you came here for.

2359
02:18:04,333 --> 02:18:06,125
Tell Sam about your wedding.

2360
02:18:06,375 --> 02:18:07,666
<i>After that, we'll leave for India.</i>

2361
02:18:07,916 --> 02:18:10,458
Hey, Idhaya, we're talking to you.

2362
02:18:10,708 --> 02:18:11,708
Say something, damn it.

2363
02:18:11,875 --> 02:18:13,124
Idhaya, please say something.

2364
02:18:13,125 --> 02:18:14,125
Everyone is asking you.

2365
02:18:15,125 --> 02:18:16,083
Answer them, Idhaya.

2366
02:18:22,250 --> 02:18:24,208
I'm sure you have a lie ready
for this situation, too.

2367
02:18:25,583 --> 02:18:28,583
These ten days,
how much have you lied to me?

2368
02:18:29,166 --> 02:18:32,541
"I came to meet an investor.
I came alone. I'm single."

2369
02:18:32,750 --> 02:18:34,583
Sam, you've misunderstood him.

2370
02:18:34,958 --> 02:18:36,166
You guys, please don't say anything.

2371
02:18:37,041 --> 02:18:38,500
Weren't you guys in on it?

2372
02:18:46,583 --> 02:18:49,083
I've never met a horrible person like you.

2373
02:18:50,750 --> 02:18:51,666
Sam!

2374
02:18:52,958 --> 02:18:53,875
Sam!

2375
02:19:04,833 --> 02:19:06,083
Sam! Sam!

2376
02:19:06,375 --> 02:19:08,083
Sam, please hear me out.

2377
02:19:08,791 --> 02:19:10,249
What more do you have
to lie about, Idhaya?

2378
02:19:10,250 --> 02:19:11,166
Go ahead.

2379
02:19:12,833 --> 02:19:14,208
I did not lie, Sam.

2380
02:19:15,291 --> 02:19:17,000
Look, I came here specifically to see you.

2381
02:19:17,208 --> 02:19:18,125
I don't get it!

2382
02:19:18,666 --> 02:19:21,041
How could you meet me when
you're getting married in a few weeks?

2383
02:19:22,833 --> 02:19:25,000
You've misunderstood me, Sam.
You're getting it all wrong.

2384
02:19:26,375 --> 02:19:27,708
Only now do I understand it clearly.

2385
02:19:28,416 --> 02:19:30,666
You're here to celebrate
your bachelor's party.

2386
02:19:31,291 --> 02:19:33,291
And all you want
is a girl to have fun with.

2387
02:19:35,291 --> 02:19:36,791
You freaking used me.

2388
02:19:38,291 --> 02:19:40,333
Listen! Your anger is fair.

2389
02:19:40,708 --> 02:19:42,499
I should've told you
about my wedding on the first day.

2390
02:19:42,500 --> 02:19:44,041
But I don't know why I didn't.

2391
02:19:44,666 --> 02:19:46,499
You've said it now. I'm leaving!

2392
02:19:46,500 --> 02:19:48,500
Sam! Sam, please let me speak.

2393
02:19:49,083 --> 02:19:50,625
At least, hear me out.

2394
02:19:51,500 --> 02:19:52,708
What's left to talk about, Idhaya?

2395
02:19:54,375 --> 02:19:55,708
You hung out with me for ten days.

2396
02:19:56,833 --> 02:19:58,666
Next, you'd invite me to your wedding.

2397
02:19:59,333 --> 02:20:00,250
No…

2398
02:20:00,875 --> 02:20:02,500
Do I look like a bitch to you?

2399
02:20:04,125 --> 02:20:06,708
At least be true to the girl
you're getting married to, Idhaya.

2400
02:20:07,791 --> 02:20:10,541
I don't care what you think about me, Sam.
I'll say what I came here to say.

2401
02:20:10,750 --> 02:20:11,750
Listen, I've always been--

2402
02:20:15,250 --> 02:20:17,416
Even now, you're only
thinking about yourself.

2403
02:20:18,583 --> 02:20:19,750
You never considered my feelings.

2404
02:20:22,791 --> 02:20:23,708
Get lost!

2405
02:21:06,625 --> 02:21:07,875
Hey, that's mine.

2406
02:21:08,083 --> 02:21:09,957
As it is, you're carrying
too much baggage.

2407
02:21:09,958 --> 02:21:11,166
And you want mine, too.
Give it to me.

2408
02:21:13,416 --> 02:21:14,458
- Okay.
- Sir.

2409
02:21:14,916 --> 02:21:16,375
You're leaving without saying anything.

2410
02:21:16,916 --> 02:21:19,000
- Oh, I forgot! Happy married life!
- I didn't mean that.

2411
02:21:19,541 --> 02:21:20,790
Sir, sir, sir, sir!

2412
02:21:20,791 --> 02:21:23,541
So, sir, where are you
headed for breakfast?

2413
02:21:23,666 --> 02:21:25,957
Madhampatty Rangaraj Catering.
You could come to the wedding.

2414
02:21:25,958 --> 02:21:27,583
- No, no, no, no!
- Please join us, sir.

2415
02:21:27,708 --> 02:21:28,958
My body can't take another plot twist.

2416
02:21:29,125 --> 02:21:30,415
I have a lot of work.
Spare me!

2417
02:21:30,416 --> 02:21:31,333
- Bye, bye, bye!
- Sir, please!

2418
02:21:32,458 --> 02:21:33,458
Where are you?

2419
02:21:33,750 --> 02:21:34,708
I've arrived!

2420
02:21:35,000 --> 02:21:36,624
<i>- I'm at the exit gate.</i>
- I'm at the arrival gate.

2421
02:21:36,625 --> 02:21:37,625
<i>Where are you?</i>

2422
02:21:52,416 --> 02:21:55,166
Teacher!
Hey, that's Geetha teacher.

2423
02:21:55,500 --> 02:21:57,208
- Teacher!
- Teacher!

2424
02:21:59,916 --> 02:22:01,541
- Who is she?
- It's our Geetha teacher.

2425
02:22:01,666 --> 02:22:03,125
She's our favorite teacher.

2426
02:22:04,083 --> 02:22:06,166
- Geetha teacher?
- Yes, Geetha teacher.

2427
02:22:11,583 --> 02:22:13,707
<i>He left a pregnant woman alone
on the verge of delivery.</i>

2428
02:22:13,708 --> 02:22:15,291
<i>He must be a classic jerk.</i>

2429
02:22:18,500 --> 02:22:20,166
Is this what you guys felt about him?

2430
02:22:22,125 --> 02:22:24,333
Sorry, ma'am, we were young,
and it was unintentional.

2431
02:22:24,541 --> 02:22:25,500
Not an issue.

2432
02:22:26,333 --> 02:22:27,666
What have you decided now?

2433
02:22:30,958 --> 02:22:31,875
I don't know.

2434
02:22:32,416 --> 02:22:35,083
Do whatever your heart says, Idhaya.

2435
02:22:36,958 --> 02:22:39,333
Ma'am, your husband says
that he's got some work.

2436
02:22:39,666 --> 02:22:41,166
At least you can come
to Idhaya's wedding.

2437
02:22:41,333 --> 02:22:43,333
- It'll be fun!
- Yeah, you should.

2438
02:22:43,583 --> 02:22:47,125
If you let them, they would narrate
a flashback to everyone.

2439
02:22:47,250 --> 02:22:48,708
Your uncle is waiting.
Leave!

2440
02:22:49,041 --> 02:22:50,791
- Sir?
- Sir?

2441
02:22:51,166 --> 02:22:52,166
We're more than this.

2442
02:22:52,416 --> 02:22:53,708
No! Leave now!

2443
02:22:54,125 --> 02:22:55,166
Hey, let's go.

2444
02:22:55,666 --> 02:22:56,875
- See you, Teacher.
- Bye.

2445
02:22:57,208 --> 02:22:58,041
Bye.

2446
02:22:58,583 --> 02:22:59,458
See you!

2447
02:23:04,166 --> 02:23:05,707
Even on the wedding day,
you guys arrive late.

2448
02:23:05,708 --> 02:23:06,665
They'll be here soon!

2449
02:23:06,666 --> 02:23:07,625
Look, they've arrived.

2450
02:23:08,000 --> 02:23:09,708
Welcome. Please, welcome.

2451
02:23:10,458 --> 02:23:11,416
- Greetings.
- In-law!

2452
02:23:11,583 --> 02:23:13,166
Oh, he has arrived.
That's great!

2453
02:23:13,625 --> 02:23:14,541
Hi!

2454
02:23:15,708 --> 02:23:16,749
Dear, greet him.

2455
02:23:16,750 --> 02:23:18,082
You keep me on my toes
until the last minute.

2456
02:23:18,083 --> 02:23:19,625
We're here now! Let's go inside!

2457
02:23:22,083 --> 02:23:23,040
Hi, Priya!

2458
02:23:23,041 --> 02:23:24,000
Welcome, Son-in-law.

2459
02:23:24,250 --> 02:23:26,207
Usually, people wait for me
at the assembly.

2460
02:23:26,208 --> 02:23:27,541
But now you have made me wait for you.

2461
02:23:27,958 --> 02:23:29,499
- I'm sorry.
- It's okay. Please come in.

2462
02:23:29,500 --> 02:23:31,082
Guys, shall we take the groom now?

2463
02:23:31,083 --> 02:23:33,375
- Please take him.
- Come on, let's go.

2464
02:23:34,541 --> 02:23:35,708
Hey, hey! Hey, hey!

2465
02:23:36,083 --> 02:23:37,790
Why are guys coming in batches?
Where is your luggage?

2466
02:23:37,791 --> 02:23:39,790
- The luggage is in the room.
- Did you bring the liquor?

2467
02:23:39,791 --> 02:23:41,707
- We never bought one.
- I asked you to get it duty-free.

2468
02:23:41,708 --> 02:23:43,750
- Uncle, here I come.
- Why is he going without being called?

2469
02:23:44,000 --> 02:23:45,208
I think they didn't buy it.

2470
02:23:46,500 --> 02:23:47,416
Hi!

2471
02:23:47,750 --> 02:23:50,000
Uncle, I want to talk to you.

2472
02:23:59,291 --> 02:24:01,375
Hey, Idhaya, are you kidding?

2473
02:24:02,708 --> 02:24:04,500
All the city's VIPs are here.

2474
02:24:04,958 --> 02:24:06,916
How could you even think
of calling off the wedding?

2475
02:24:07,666 --> 02:24:09,458
Only after you said yes
did I go ahead with this marriage.

2476
02:24:09,583 --> 02:24:11,332
You were with that girl
for the past six months

2477
02:24:11,333 --> 02:24:13,374
but now you don't want her.

2478
02:24:13,375 --> 02:24:14,625
What would people think about us?

2479
02:24:15,500 --> 02:24:17,916
Forget people.
What do I tell Adhithi?

2480
02:24:20,166 --> 02:24:22,083
Have I ever said no to anything
you've asked of me?

2481
02:24:22,500 --> 02:24:24,625
Or have I forced you to do anything?

2482
02:24:25,750 --> 02:24:26,958
Please understand the situation.

2483
02:24:27,083 --> 02:24:28,583
Adhithi is the right match for you.

2484
02:24:29,375 --> 02:24:31,875
When we don't get what we wish for,
it does hurt.

2485
02:24:32,166 --> 02:24:34,541
But if we don't get what we need,
our life will be ruined.

2486
02:24:34,791 --> 02:24:35,708
Please understand.

2487
02:24:35,958 --> 02:24:38,500
Look, I'm not just your uncle,

2488
02:24:38,791 --> 02:24:40,250
I'm your parent as well.

2489
02:24:40,708 --> 02:24:42,916
If you feel the same way,
for God's sake, come to the wedding.

2490
02:24:43,541 --> 02:24:44,957
It's time! They're calling for the groom.

2491
02:24:44,958 --> 02:24:46,000
Hey, I'll be out! Get lost!

2492
02:25:11,875 --> 02:25:14,583
You want me to call off this wedding?

2493
02:25:16,166 --> 02:25:19,333
Okay.
No matter what, I'll face everything.

2494
02:25:20,666 --> 02:25:21,916
You don't worry about it.

2495
02:25:23,083 --> 02:25:25,708
I'll handle it. I'll face it.

2496
02:25:26,208 --> 02:25:27,125
Fine!

2497
02:25:27,375 --> 02:25:28,833
Not an issue. I'll handle it.

2498
02:25:29,500 --> 02:25:32,041
Uncle, bring me my wedding clothes.

2499
02:25:32,958 --> 02:25:34,500
I'll be ready in five minutes.

2500
02:25:37,416 --> 02:25:39,833
Idhaya, I'll convince everyone.

2501
02:25:39,958 --> 02:25:41,291
You don't have to say anything.

2502
02:25:41,625 --> 02:25:42,541
I'm at fault.

2503
02:25:43,166 --> 02:25:44,291
You go ahead. I'll follow shortly.

2504
02:25:45,458 --> 02:25:47,875
Listen, don't confuse yourself.

2505
02:25:48,041 --> 02:25:49,500
I want only what you wish for.

2506
02:25:49,708 --> 02:25:50,625
Am I right, Son?

2507
02:25:52,250 --> 02:25:53,166
Okay.

2508
02:26:00,666 --> 02:26:03,041
<i>- Sachin bro, you are saved for now.
- Yes, Dravid!</i>

2509
02:26:03,208 --> 02:26:04,333
Hey, Uncle!

2510
02:26:04,958 --> 02:26:06,666
I upheld my promise
and brought Idhaya on time.

2511
02:26:07,666 --> 02:26:09,208
I understood your plan.

2512
02:26:09,708 --> 02:26:10,625
What plan?

2513
02:26:11,125 --> 02:26:14,124
You're pretending to get ready for the
wedding but you're planning to cancel it.

2514
02:26:14,125 --> 02:26:15,041
Isn't that your plan?

2515
02:26:15,250 --> 02:26:17,291
If I were in your situation,
I would've planned the same.

2516
02:26:17,833 --> 02:26:18,832
What's the point of friendship

2517
02:26:18,833 --> 02:26:20,666
if you don't
help your friend be with the one he loves?

2518
02:26:21,041 --> 02:26:22,333
I won't let it happen.

2519
02:26:22,875 --> 02:26:24,332
He will get married to Adhithi.

2520
02:26:24,333 --> 02:26:26,083
That's good for him,
and he has understood it.

2521
02:26:26,583 --> 02:26:27,916
I expect you guys
to understand it as well.

2522
02:26:28,416 --> 02:26:30,875
Instead, if you think of
doing something stupid…

2523
02:26:31,208 --> 02:26:32,375
I won't spare you guys.

2524
02:26:32,833 --> 02:26:33,750
Hey!

2525
02:26:34,541 --> 02:26:36,958
- You look suspicious to me.
- Don't worry about me, Uncle.

2526
02:26:40,166 --> 02:26:43,083
How come we didn't think about
what Uncle just said about Idhaya?

2527
02:26:43,375 --> 02:26:45,958
It's our duty to help Idhaya
unite with his true love.

2528
02:26:46,166 --> 02:26:47,500
Only then are we responsible friends.

2529
02:26:47,666 --> 02:26:49,208
We're not good friends, dude.

2530
02:26:49,958 --> 02:26:51,875
- Damn!
- What can we do about it now?

2531
02:26:52,000 --> 02:26:53,000
We'll cancel the wedding.

2532
02:26:54,166 --> 02:26:55,708
We unite Idhaya and Samantha.

2533
02:26:56,208 --> 02:26:57,291
Okay, we'll unite them!

2534
02:26:57,416 --> 02:26:59,125
- Yeah, we'll unite them.
- Yes, guys!

2535
02:26:59,291 --> 02:27:00,583
I won't let it happen!

2536
02:27:01,250 --> 02:27:03,332
Hey, Team America.
I'm Team Adhithi.

2537
02:27:03,333 --> 02:27:04,750
- Adhithi?
- Yes!

2538
02:27:05,083 --> 02:27:06,666
I will make sure your plan fails

2539
02:27:06,833 --> 02:27:08,416
and unite Adhithi and Idhaya.

2540
02:27:08,541 --> 02:27:09,791
I swear on Uncle.

2541
02:27:10,083 --> 02:27:10,999
I'm leaving!

2542
02:27:11,000 --> 02:27:11,916
Hey, Juju!

2543
02:27:12,041 --> 02:27:12,957
- Hey Juju!
- Hey!

2544
02:27:12,958 --> 02:27:14,207
Brother, ignore him.

2545
02:27:14,208 --> 02:27:16,000
He's pissed off because we didn't
get him whiskey from the US.

2546
02:27:16,208 --> 02:27:17,625
- Let's follow our plan.
- Guys, please focus.

2547
02:27:17,833 --> 02:27:20,041
We only have two hours left.
Let's go!

2548
02:27:20,708 --> 02:27:22,457
Many VIPs are dining tonight.

2549
02:27:22,458 --> 02:27:24,832
Make sure to add
plenty of dried fruit in the dessert.

2550
02:27:24,833 --> 02:27:26,791
Set dried fruits aside.
There are more pressing issues to tend to.

2551
02:27:27,458 --> 02:27:28,375
Take a look.

2552
02:27:31,083 --> 02:27:31,999
What the hell is this?

2553
02:27:32,000 --> 02:27:33,415
- Sir.
- He's my friend.

2554
02:27:33,416 --> 02:27:35,165
Still, it's a matter of a girl's life.

2555
02:27:35,166 --> 02:27:37,957
Please manage to stop this wedding
and save a girl's life.

2556
02:27:37,958 --> 02:27:39,916
- Hey! Hey!
- Take a look at this, sir.

2557
02:27:41,333 --> 02:27:43,332
- Two people!
- How did this happen?

2558
02:27:43,333 --> 02:27:46,040
I've never touched another woman
other than my wife.

2559
02:27:46,041 --> 02:27:48,457
I don't understand how I ended up
putting my arms around these girls.

2560
02:27:48,458 --> 02:27:49,957
- It's AI.
- What does it mean?

2561
02:27:49,958 --> 02:27:52,457
Using this, we can make a good person
look bad, and a bad person look good.

2562
02:27:52,458 --> 02:27:54,207
Also, we can turn truth into a lie
and a lie into truth.

2563
02:27:54,208 --> 02:27:55,457
We can do anything we want.

2564
02:27:55,458 --> 02:27:56,416
They're from a news channel.

2565
02:27:57,000 --> 02:28:00,333
They're planning to get
you trapped in a scandal.

2566
02:28:00,958 --> 02:28:03,916
- The groom is a noble person like you.
- Damn, he's ruining our plan.

2567
02:28:04,458 --> 02:28:06,082
Thank goodness you saved me.

2568
02:28:06,083 --> 02:28:07,291
I almost believed them.

2569
02:28:07,708 --> 02:28:10,332
Hey, he explained that it's all AI.
I know now.

2570
02:28:10,333 --> 02:28:11,458
Mind your business!

2571
02:28:12,000 --> 02:28:14,708
Team America -0.
Team Adhithi -1.

2572
02:28:14,833 --> 02:28:16,999
- I'll meet you in round 2.
- Hey, what's wrong with him?

2573
02:28:17,000 --> 02:28:18,541
Dude, come on, let's plan something else.

2574
02:28:19,000 --> 02:28:20,082
- Hi, bro!
- Hi, bro!

2575
02:28:20,083 --> 02:28:22,291
- Greetings, are you the DJ?
- Greetings, I'm the DJ.

2576
02:28:22,500 --> 02:28:24,291
Bro, you must play a song now.

2577
02:28:24,625 --> 02:28:27,541
That should make the groom throw away
the garland and run off the stage.

2578
02:28:27,708 --> 02:28:28,707
It should move him.

2579
02:28:28,708 --> 02:28:30,249
I got you, bro!
What kind of song?

2580
02:28:30,250 --> 02:28:32,500
"All of me, someone like you…"
Like these songs?

2581
02:28:32,625 --> 02:28:34,500
- If you play these, they'll doze off.
- Is it?

2582
02:28:34,875 --> 02:28:36,583
Please play the songs on this list.

2583
02:28:36,708 --> 02:28:38,041
Everything else will happen on its own.

2584
02:28:41,958 --> 02:28:43,790
- Bro.. I got you, brother.
- Play it!

2585
02:28:43,791 --> 02:28:44,708
I got you.

2586
02:28:55,000 --> 02:28:57,666
{\an8}<i>O Heart of mine</i>

2587
02:28:57,916 --> 02:29:00,875
<i>You're one of a kind</i>

2588
02:29:01,041 --> 02:29:03,250
<i>O Heart of mine</i>

2589
02:29:03,666 --> 02:29:06,291
<i>My throbbing love</i>

2590
02:29:06,583 --> 02:29:12,415
<i>For wisdom and flesh alike,
The journey is endless</i>

2591
02:29:12,416 --> 02:29:17,916
<i>Every dream whispers to the heart...</i>

2592
02:29:28,916 --> 02:29:32,250
So, you lied to me and went to America.

2593
02:29:32,791 --> 02:29:34,166
That's not the problem now.

2594
02:29:34,458 --> 02:29:36,166
Give me an idea to call off the wedding.

2595
02:29:43,458 --> 02:29:46,750
Bro, what kind of songs are you playing?
It doesn't give any wedding vibes.

2596
02:29:47,208 --> 02:29:49,290
Bro, I know what to do.

2597
02:29:49,291 --> 02:29:51,166
Don't tell me how to do my job.

2598
02:29:51,500 --> 02:29:52,666
If you keep up this nonsense…

2599
02:29:52,916 --> 02:29:54,666
Only the equipment will leave this place,
not you.

2600
02:29:55,583 --> 02:29:57,374
- Bro, bro, bro, bro…
- Play rocking songs!

2601
02:29:57,375 --> 02:29:59,708
Bro, I'm bad at this language.

2602
02:29:59,833 --> 02:30:01,208
Language is never a problem.

2603
02:30:01,458 --> 02:30:03,541
The song should be rocking!

2604
02:30:05,583 --> 02:30:07,791
I think this should work for you, brother.

2605
02:30:54,375 --> 02:30:55,416
Sit here.

2606
02:30:57,000 --> 02:30:57,916
Hello!

2607
02:31:04,833 --> 02:31:07,083
- It's very wrong of you.
- What did I do wrong?

2608
02:31:07,625 --> 02:31:09,000
You should've gone with Idhaya.

2609
02:31:09,458 --> 02:31:11,124
He called you along for moral support.

2610
02:31:11,125 --> 02:31:12,500
It was wrong of you to avoid him.

2611
02:31:12,625 --> 02:31:14,208
It's his life.
He must make a decision.

2612
02:31:14,708 --> 02:31:15,625
Oh!

2613
02:31:16,208 --> 02:31:18,291
It was your wife and child.

2614
02:31:18,625 --> 02:31:20,666
But he never waited,
thinking it was your responsibility.

2615
02:31:21,250 --> 02:31:24,833
You don't have the magnanimity
that young kid had.

2616
02:31:25,541 --> 02:31:27,000
Are you seriously comparing me to him?

2617
02:31:27,708 --> 02:31:30,583
You didn't want to take a leave
when I went into labor.

2618
02:31:30,833 --> 02:31:33,000
But he signed the form and was with me.

2619
02:31:37,000 --> 02:31:39,291
To you, the Swiss were important.

2620
02:31:39,500 --> 02:31:41,625
To him, his teacher was important.

2621
02:31:45,583 --> 02:31:47,958
You were running to build a future.

2622
02:31:48,375 --> 02:31:50,625
But he came looking for his teacher.

2623
02:31:54,833 --> 02:31:57,541
- He was there with me--
- Dear, please stop!

2624
02:31:58,333 --> 02:32:00,583
The more you talk,

2625
02:32:00,833 --> 02:32:04,250
my ears are ringing with
a melodramatic background score.

2626
02:32:06,500 --> 02:32:09,500
I'm convinced.
We'll leave right away for the wedding.

2627
02:32:10,958 --> 02:32:12,625
- Lado, decorations look good.
- Hello, ma'am.

2628
02:32:14,291 --> 02:32:15,833
What's going to happen now?

2629
02:32:17,166 --> 02:32:18,583
- The wedding will happen.
- Sir?

2630
02:32:21,000 --> 02:32:22,416
Madhampatty Catering.

2631
02:32:22,625 --> 02:32:24,083
I'm going to feast today.

2632
02:32:24,208 --> 02:32:25,750
- Sir, what do we do?
- Thank you.

2633
02:32:27,208 --> 02:32:28,166
What's with sassing?

2634
02:32:29,166 --> 02:32:32,083
We brought the love of his life to him.

2635
02:32:32,583 --> 02:32:35,000
If this does not bowl him over,
I don't know what else would.

2636
02:32:35,125 --> 02:32:36,041
Let's see!

2637
02:32:36,916 --> 02:32:41,250
Son, Son-in-law, my daughter's groom,

2638
02:32:41,791 --> 02:32:43,833
our pride and the King of our family.

2639
02:32:44,458 --> 02:32:45,625
You are a masterpiece beyond compare,

2640
02:32:46,041 --> 02:32:47,208
a garland of fragrance,

2641
02:32:47,375 --> 02:32:49,291
a haven of joy,
and a grove that offers solace.

2642
02:32:49,958 --> 02:32:52,125
Sheesh! Will he finish it today?

2643
02:32:52,291 --> 02:32:56,000
Despite being busy with the wedding,
in order to develop his business,

2644
02:32:56,166 --> 02:32:59,749
he went to America
and met President Trump.

2645
02:32:59,750 --> 02:33:02,208
<i>Your sincerity and hard work
have stunned me.</i>

2646
02:33:02,333 --> 02:33:05,040
Sir, he's a martyr
who sacrificed his love for his Uncle.

2647
02:33:05,041 --> 02:33:05,958
Yeah, right.

2648
02:33:06,083 --> 02:33:08,333
Martyrs don't get girls, only a pension.

2649
02:33:08,625 --> 02:33:10,833
He's an old timer. Scrap material.

2650
02:33:11,000 --> 02:33:12,916
What do we do now?
Is there no other option?

2651
02:33:13,291 --> 02:33:15,416
- There's an option.
- What is it, sir?

2652
02:33:15,541 --> 02:33:19,291
I must appreciate his Uncle
for raising an honest person.

2653
02:33:20,958 --> 02:33:23,041
- Sir?
- Let me appreciate him.

2654
02:33:23,708 --> 02:33:24,625
- Sir!
- Sachin, my bro!

2655
02:33:24,750 --> 02:33:26,208
Nice to see you again, sir.

2656
02:33:26,791 --> 02:33:28,083
Uncle, he's our friend.

2657
02:33:29,291 --> 02:33:30,625
- Surya!
- Hello, Surya!

2658
02:33:30,916 --> 02:33:31,916
You both are exceptional.

2659
02:33:32,125 --> 02:33:34,958
I've never seen such a great
uncle-and-nephew combo.

2660
02:33:35,791 --> 02:33:38,708
- He's gold, sir.
- Gold, sir. Truly gold.

2661
02:33:39,083 --> 02:33:40,374
In this day and age,

2662
02:33:40,375 --> 02:33:42,416
no one would sacrifice
the woman he loves for his uncle.

2663
02:33:43,625 --> 02:33:44,541
But he did!

2664
02:33:46,250 --> 02:33:48,791
Don't be afraid.
I won't speak like my father.

2665
02:33:50,333 --> 02:33:53,375
You sacrificed your life for his sake.

2666
02:33:53,958 --> 02:33:57,083
I'm sure he would sacrifice
the love of his life for you.

2667
02:33:58,541 --> 02:33:59,458
But there's one thing…

2668
02:34:00,250 --> 02:34:01,250
His heart will be crying.

2669
02:34:02,750 --> 02:34:04,208
Eventually, he'll be okay.

2670
02:34:04,500 --> 02:34:06,500
You have done a lot for him.

2671
02:34:06,791 --> 02:34:09,166
This is very small compared
to what you did for him.

2672
02:34:09,833 --> 02:34:10,750
He'll be okay.

2673
02:34:14,250 --> 02:34:16,166
Okay, sir. I'll be around.

2674
02:34:16,333 --> 02:34:17,708
I'll stay until everything is over.

2675
02:34:42,166 --> 02:34:43,166
Greetings to all.

2676
02:34:44,875 --> 02:34:46,833
Today is my nephew, Idhaya's wedding.

2677
02:34:47,625 --> 02:34:50,375
He is both a blessing and a cherished
relationship bestowed upon me by God

2678
02:34:50,625 --> 02:34:53,041
so that I don't end up lonely
in this world.

2679
02:34:54,166 --> 02:34:57,708
For 30 years now,
we have lived for each other.

2680
02:34:57,875 --> 02:35:01,000
Until now,
he has never asked me for anything.

2681
02:35:02,083 --> 02:35:06,041
He probably felt that I would be upset
if he asked for it.

2682
02:35:06,958 --> 02:35:08,208
Such a gem of a boy, my Idhaya,

2683
02:35:08,541 --> 02:35:09,791
for the first time,

2684
02:35:10,166 --> 02:35:12,541
he asked me for something
from the bottom of his heart.

2685
02:35:13,916 --> 02:35:15,291
But I denied him.

2686
02:35:15,916 --> 02:35:17,166
But he was not upset about it.

2687
02:35:17,583 --> 02:35:18,958
The life he rightfully deserves,

2688
02:35:19,416 --> 02:35:22,333
he threw it away
to uphold his respect for my word

2689
02:35:22,750 --> 02:35:23,875
and is sitting here to get married.

2690
02:35:26,875 --> 02:35:28,416
If I still remain silent,

2691
02:35:29,041 --> 02:35:31,916
whatever I did till date for him

2692
02:35:33,291 --> 02:35:34,291
would hold no meaning.

2693
02:35:34,916 --> 02:35:37,083
Dear Adhithi, please forgive me.

2694
02:35:38,666 --> 02:35:42,208
I know what you would go through
if this wedding is called off.

2695
02:35:42,583 --> 02:35:43,500
Hey!

2696
02:35:44,541 --> 02:35:45,916
But if we go through with this wedding,

2697
02:35:46,583 --> 02:35:49,958
neither of you will be happy
even for a moment in your lives.

2698
02:35:51,916 --> 02:35:52,916
What's happening?

2699
02:35:53,333 --> 02:35:55,250
Everyone on the stage, please forgive me.

2700
02:35:55,791 --> 02:35:58,875
If you could graciously
cancel this wedding,

2701
02:36:00,125 --> 02:36:02,041
- and help him start his new life...
- What's happening out here?

2702
02:36:02,541 --> 02:36:03,582
Are you kidding me?

2703
02:36:03,583 --> 02:36:05,415
Hey, Siva Subramaniam, come here.

2704
02:36:05,416 --> 02:36:07,375
Nothing's wrong, Chief.
Please wait a minute.

2705
02:36:07,500 --> 02:36:09,958
There's been a confusion.
Nothing's wrong.

2706
02:36:10,833 --> 02:36:12,708
- Adhithi, nothing is wrong.
- Adhithi!

2707
02:36:13,083 --> 02:36:14,750
Dad, hold on!

2708
02:36:15,125 --> 02:36:17,583
Making a fuss
won't make this wedding happen.

2709
02:36:18,041 --> 02:36:19,333
Even if we make it happen,

2710
02:36:19,500 --> 02:36:23,500
how do I marry someone who
does not love me and make a life with him?

2711
02:36:23,791 --> 02:36:25,625
Sorry, sir, please forgive me.

2712
02:36:25,875 --> 02:36:27,915
- You came here to bless us.
- It's okay, dear.

2713
02:36:27,916 --> 02:36:28,833
But…

2714
02:36:30,083 --> 02:36:32,875
I'm sorry,
this wedding is not happening anymore.

2715
02:36:33,333 --> 02:36:35,208
Please forgive us.

2716
02:37:09,166 --> 02:37:10,166
Is the wedding over?

2717
02:37:10,791 --> 02:37:12,041
I didn't hear the nuptial beats.

2718
02:37:14,625 --> 02:37:17,083
To call off the wedding,
you brought his lover.

2719
02:37:17,208 --> 02:37:18,750
Did you ever consider my plight?

2720
02:37:18,916 --> 02:37:20,666
I only thought about <i>your</i> life.

2721
02:37:21,458 --> 02:37:23,666
For whose benefit do you think
I called off the wedding?

2722
02:37:24,208 --> 02:37:25,791
It's for your good.
Hand it to me.

2723
02:37:26,666 --> 02:37:28,166
Are you saying he's a bad man?

2724
02:37:28,375 --> 02:37:31,625
Nah, he's a good man.
That's the problem.

2725
02:37:32,416 --> 02:37:36,208
But don't assume
that he's smart and romantic.

2726
02:37:37,083 --> 02:37:39,708
Even if he's held at gunpoint,
he can't romance.

2727
02:37:41,000 --> 02:37:44,250
Actually, I saved you.

2728
02:37:44,666 --> 02:37:45,583
You owe me, bro.

2729
02:37:47,958 --> 02:37:48,958
Are you trying to convince me?

2730
02:37:49,958 --> 02:37:54,250
On the flight, I listened to his
entire flashback for 16 hours.

2731
02:37:55,416 --> 02:37:59,791
Even 20 years weren't enough for him
to propose to the love of his life.

2732
02:38:00,000 --> 02:38:03,166
He has to fall in love with you
and then propose...

2733
02:38:03,500 --> 02:38:05,333
Imagine for yourself
how long it will take.

2734
02:38:05,625 --> 02:38:06,541
You escaped!

2735
02:38:12,125 --> 02:38:13,416
Girl, that's my cigarette.

2736
02:38:14,708 --> 02:38:16,416
Go and complete what's left.

2737
02:38:16,958 --> 02:38:18,083
We have to end with "All is well."

2738
02:38:22,791 --> 02:38:24,625
Make it up for what you lost
in the coaching class.

2739
02:38:27,041 --> 02:38:29,041
- Where's your twin sister?
- Twin sister?

2740
02:38:30,208 --> 02:38:32,000
Not bad! You identified me.

2741
02:38:34,791 --> 02:38:36,790
- I don't repeat my mistakes.
- Are you not Samantha?

2742
02:38:36,791 --> 02:38:38,665
- Hey…
- Are you serious?

2743
02:38:38,666 --> 02:38:39,583
Did you know?

2744
02:38:39,750 --> 02:38:40,875
I couldn't spot the difference.

2745
02:38:43,208 --> 02:38:44,165
Hello.

2746
02:38:44,166 --> 02:38:46,625
Sir, you kept us in the dark
and surprised us.

2747
02:38:46,916 --> 02:38:50,666
Look, we only had two hours,
and I brought who I could.

2748
02:38:50,833 --> 02:38:52,666
Whatever, we called off the wedding.

2749
02:38:52,833 --> 02:38:53,791
Well done!

2750
02:38:56,625 --> 02:38:58,291
Hey, Idhaya!
Is she not the girl?

2751
02:38:58,750 --> 02:39:00,000
Then who's the girl?

2752
02:39:00,541 --> 02:39:01,666
This girl's sister.

2753
02:39:02,208 --> 02:39:03,708
- Where is she now?
- In America.

2754
02:39:05,083 --> 02:39:07,500
Oh, God, please save me from them.

2755
02:39:07,666 --> 02:39:09,915
{\an8}Chill, Uncle.
We'll take care of it in the sequel.

2756
02:39:09,916 --> 02:39:12,750
{\an8}ALL IS WELL

2757
02:39:31,083 --> 02:39:33,125
Hey, what's your problem?

2758
02:39:33,541 --> 02:39:34,916
Didn't I tell you already?

2759
02:39:35,916 --> 02:39:36,958
He's a good boy.

2760
02:39:37,666 --> 02:39:39,750
Hey, shut up.
I know him well.

2761
02:39:40,375 --> 02:39:41,708
{\an8}We all approve of him.

2762
02:39:42,125 --> 02:39:43,333
{\an8}What have you decided now?

2763
02:39:43,708 --> 02:39:45,416
{\an8}Hey, stop with your drama.

2764
02:39:45,583 --> 02:39:47,915
{\an8}We noticed how cozy you guys were
in New York.

2765
02:39:47,916 --> 02:39:49,082
{\an8}You guys have sung a duet.

2766
02:39:49,083 --> 02:39:50,624
{\an8}Do you still expect him
to make the first move?

2767
02:39:50,625 --> 02:39:51,708
{\an8}You're right!

2768
02:39:52,083 --> 02:39:53,083
{\an8}You want him to come?

2769
02:39:54,041 --> 02:39:56,291
{\an8}Oh, so the entire gang is here.

2770
02:39:56,625 --> 02:39:58,958
{\an8}You can talk all you want.
I reckon he's out there.

2771
02:39:59,458 --> 02:40:01,000
{\an8}Ask him
to look me in the face and propose.

2772
02:40:01,291 --> 02:40:02,541
{\an8}I'll forget about everything.

2773
02:40:03,708 --> 02:40:04,625
{\an8}<i>Dude, come over here.</i>

2774
02:40:05,083 --> 02:40:06,375
{\an8}- Hi, Sam!
- Finally, you appeared.

2775
02:40:07,583 --> 02:40:09,916
{\an8}Except for you, everyone else
is saying that you're in love with me.

2776
02:40:10,125 --> 02:40:11,916
{\an8}This call will last
only for another 40 seconds.

2777
02:40:12,625 --> 02:40:13,625
{\an8}Now's the time for you to say it.

2778
02:40:15,291 --> 02:40:16,625
{\an8}They've switched on the theatre lights.

2779
02:40:17,291 --> 02:40:18,874
{\an8}Hey, look at me.

2780
02:40:18,875 --> 02:40:20,791
{\an8}Rolling credits of the crane operator
is on screen now.

2781
02:40:20,916 --> 02:40:22,791
{\an8}For God's sake,
propose before the rolling titles end.

2782
02:40:23,291 --> 02:40:25,458
{\an8}The audience has started
to look for parking tickets.

2783
02:40:25,625 --> 02:40:26,625
{\an8}Please say it.

2784
02:40:27,166 --> 02:40:29,458
{\an8}I'm feeling shy looking at you
being all shy.

2785
02:40:29,750 --> 02:40:30,666
{\an8}Say it!

2786
02:40:31,541 --> 02:40:32,499
{\an8}Idhaya…

2787
02:40:32,500 --> 02:40:34,208
{\an8}He won't propose. Please leave.

2788
02:40:34,500 --> 02:40:36,333
{\an8}He's never going to muster the courage.

2789
02:40:36,875 --> 02:40:38,000
{\an8}Everyone, please shut up.

2790
02:40:38,250 --> 02:40:39,208
{\an8}I'm going to say it.

2791
02:40:40,375 --> 02:40:41,291
{\an8}I'll handle it.

2792
02:40:43,291 --> 02:40:44,208
{\an8}Super!

2793
02:40:46,166 --> 02:40:47,083
{\an8}Sam…

2794
02:40:49,250 --> 02:40:50,166
{\an8}I--

2795
02:40:51,000 --> 02:40:51,916
{\an8}I…



